(1759720, 238968, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful high contrast  image, but I don''t see complimentary colors from any color wheel. I would need purple or blue or possibly green in order for that to be the case as orange of the beak and feet is the only true color. The contrast is great with the black and white. I love the lighting and the dark  background, but the opposite color just isn''t there.  :~(</td>', 'This is a beautiful high contrast  image, but I don''t see complimentary colors from any color wheel. I would need purple or blue or possibly green in order for that to be the case as orange of the beak and feet is the only true color. The contrast is great with the black and white. I love the lighting and the dark  background, but the opposite color just isn''t there.  :~(', '2005-10-05 01:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
