(1759997, 239818, 17507, '<td valign="top">really a nice glow. I like the distinctly different colors that the light causes the leaves to assume. high saturation works well. some noise reduction software would have helped even out the blue background.</td>', 'really a nice glow. I like the distinctly different colors that the light causes the leaves to assume. high saturation works well. some noise reduction software would have helped even out the blue background.', '2005-10-05 02:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760000, 240232, 17507, '<td valign="top">the inclusion of so much hat seems arbitrary, and the shadow in the upper right pulls the eye strongly. i''m thinking a 3/4 angle on this girl would be nice to see.</td>', 'the inclusion of so much hat seems arbitrary, and the shadow in the upper right pulls the eye strongly. i''m thinking a 3/4 angle on this girl would be nice to see.', '2005-10-05 02:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760004, 239752, 17507, '<td valign="top">the harsh patterns of highlight and shadow make this image a difficult one to read well. you''d probably have had better luck with this shot if you''d taken it later in the day, when the light comes from a lower angle.</td>', 'the harsh patterns of highlight and shadow make this image a difficult one to read well. you''d probably have had better luck with this shot if you''d taken it later in the day, when the light comes from a lower angle.', '2005-10-05 02:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760007, 240228, 17507, '<td valign="top">i like the textures in this picture, and the colors and tones of the rose. but a photo like this needs strong lines in it. look at the most dominant lines in the picture--where do they lead? out of the frame, or nowhere. try to arrange a still life such as this so that the strong lines point inward, toward your intended focal point.</td>', 'i like the textures in this picture, and the colors and tones of the rose. but a photo like this needs strong lines in it. look at the most dominant lines in the picture--where do they lead? out of the frame, or nowhere. try to arrange a still life such as this so that the strong lines point inward, toward your intended focal point.', '2005-10-05 02:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
