(1760600, 240604, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a clever imagination.  I like that it isn''t a leaf or a sunset. LOL  I like that her bangs separate and you can see part of her forehead. If the rose and the ribbon were exactly the same color, that would be really cool, but no deductions because they aren''t. the composition is good.  I might crop so you didn''t see that tiny bit of skin on her upper right arm.  I''d have her remove her nail polish, but that''s just little nit pick stuff.  Overall - well composed, imagined and executed.</td>', 'What a clever imagination.  I like that it isn''t a leaf or a sunset. LOL  I like that her bangs separate and you can see part of her forehead. If the rose and the ribbon were exactly the same color, that would be really cool, but no deductions because they aren''t. the composition is good.  I might crop so you didn''t see that tiny bit of skin on her upper right arm.  I''d have her remove her nail polish, but that''s just little nit pick stuff.  Overall - well composed, imagined and executed.', '2005-10-05 08:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760602, 238924, 15711, '<td valign="top">Of all the leaves, I think this is one of my favorites.  It''s simple, there is enough detail, and it certainly meets the challenge. I don''t recognize this type of leaf.  What is it??? The composition is good and I like the use of the (green) negative space. the almost diagonal sense of the paint or texture stroke of the green (wall? floor?) adds a bit of texture without making it busy and complicated.  The minimalist approach most certainly works here 8</td>', 'Of all the leaves, I think this is one of my favorites.  It''s simple, there is enough detail, and it certainly meets the challenge. I don''t recognize this type of leaf.  What is it??? The composition is good and I like the use of the (green) negative space. the almost diagonal sense of the paint or texture stroke of the green (wall? floor?) adds a bit of texture without making it busy and complicated.  The minimalist approach most certainly works here 8', '2005-10-05 09:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760603, 239274, 21513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place. Beautiful shot. 8</td>', 'Beautiful place. Beautiful shot. 8', '2005-10-05 09:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760605, 240596, 34255, '<td valign="top">that looks more red  than orange</td>', 'that looks more red  than orange', '2005-10-05 09:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760606, 239608, 43191, '<td valign="top">Had to ask my electricion Husband what these were. He says they are pretty small, so in that case, well done on the close up!</td>', 'Had to ask my electricion Husband what these were. He says they are pretty small, so in that case, well done on the close up!', '2005-10-05 09:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760608, 240228, 43191, '<td valign="top">A pretty shot.</td>', 'A pretty shot.', '2005-10-05 09:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760611, 240198, 15711, '<td valign="top">With a tad differentfocus, this could really be something.  I feel as if the shirt is a bit more clear than the face. Maybe that was your intent, as the yellow and green are the complementary colors.  For some reason, I like the sunglasses too. The crop is good and I don''t even mind him being so centered in the shot. The dappled light is pretty and the DOF is well executed.</td>', 'With a tad differentfocus, this could really be something.  I feel as if the shirt is a bit more clear than the face. Maybe that was your intent, as the yellow and green are the complementary colors.  For some reason, I like the sunglasses too. The crop is good and I don''t even mind him being so centered in the shot. The dappled light is pretty and the DOF is well executed.', '2005-10-05 09:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760612, 240350, 43191, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty specky shot! Very nice.</td>', 'This is a pretty specky shot! Very nice.', '2005-10-05 09:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760613, 238971, 43191, '<td valign="top">Love the vibrant orange.</td>', 'Love the vibrant orange.', '2005-10-05 09:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760614, 239951, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really love the shape of umbrellas.  This is it''s own color wheel!  I wish you had incorporated more negative (sand) space on either side of it.  With this setting and relatively tight crop, it kind of has a targe bullseyet effect.  The clarity is good and it certainly meets the challenge. 7</td>', 'I really love the shape of umbrellas.  This is it''s own color wheel!  I wish you had incorporated more negative (sand) space on either side of it.  With this setting and relatively tight crop, it kind of has a targe bullseyet effect.  The clarity is good and it certainly meets the challenge. 7', '2005-10-05 09:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760615, 240591, 34255, '<td valign="top">SO contrived, and I usually hate that...but it''s so cute and well-done...</td>', 'SO contrived, and I usually hate that...but it''s so cute and well-done...', '2005-10-05 09:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760616, 240561, 43191, '<td valign="top">Great vibrant colours.</td>', 'Great vibrant colours.', '2005-10-05 09:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760617, 238048, 21513, '<td valign="top">Not the right colors.</td>', 'Not the right colors.', '2005-10-05 09:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760618, 238499, 44743, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a perfect find for this challenge! Love the colors. The payphone adds a lot.</td>', 'Wow, what a perfect find for this challenge! Love the colors. The payphone adds a lot.', '2005-10-05 09:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760619, 240551, 37961, '<td valign="top">Something strikes me as gross here. The colors are great but those lips are not in a flattering pose...LOL I have to give it to you though, this is the most shocking photo in the challenge.</td>', 'Something strikes me as gross here. The colors are great but those lips are not in a flattering pose...LOL I have to give it to you though, this is the most shocking photo in the challenge.', '2005-10-05 09:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760621, 240531, 15711, '<td valign="top">My sorority colors!! LOL <br/> <br/>I love the idea of this.  I like the up and down sense of the pencil points.  IT seems slightly out of focus to me. Perhaps on a pure white background, they might''ve had just a bit more pop. You could achieve that with basic editing by doing a selective color adjustment (white) and using the slide tool to remove all of the other colosr that dirty it up a bit. Good composition and lighting.</td>', 'My sorority colors!! LOL  I love the idea of this.  I like the up and down sense of the pencil points.  IT seems slightly out of focus to me. Perhaps on a pure white background, they might''ve had just a bit more pop. You could achieve that with basic editing by doing a selective color adjustment (white) and using the slide tool to remove all of the other colosr that dirty it up a bit. Good composition and lighting.', '2005-10-05 09:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760623, 240604, 43191, '<td valign="top">Great photo, I particularly like the ribbon against the dark hair amongst the green.</td>', 'Great photo, I particularly like the ribbon against the dark hair amongst the green.', '2005-10-05 09:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760625, 240503, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m a huge fan of berries and vines.  I like the close up and detail of the brick and mortar. The diagonal line of the vine is a nice touch.</td>', 'I''m a huge fan of berries and vines.  I like the close up and detail of the brick and mortar. The diagonal line of the vine is a nice touch.', '2005-10-05 09:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760628, 240581, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this. The lighting is spot on. My only complaint is the crop.  I''d like to see the tip of the fern and the whole blossom of the rose.</td>', 'I like the idea of this. The lighting is spot on. My only complaint is the crop.  I''d like to see the tip of the fern and the whole blossom of the rose.', '2005-10-05 09:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760630, 240173, 9111, '<td valign="top">Another lovely photo of Pupae :)     Verynice!</td>', 'Another lovely photo of Pupae :)     Verynice!', '2005-10-05 09:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760631, 240591, 44743, '<td valign="top">Very creative concept, nice implementation. The "walking" brushes look great.  Shame you can see the stand for the blue brush.</td>', 'Very creative concept, nice implementation. The "walking" brushes look great.  Shame you can see the stand for the blue brush.', '2005-10-05 09:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760632, 240583, 36199, '<td valign="top">a beautiful image,</td>', 'a beautiful image,', '2005-10-05 09:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760637, 240142, 15711, '<td valign="top">The colors work well, but it seems out of focus to me.  The rule of thirds is achieved but without the tack sharp focus on the dying bush, it kind of loses something. I''d like to see less of the rocky foreground ame possibly more sky to really give this photo some snap.</td>', 'The colors work well, but it seems out of focus to me.  The rule of thirds is achieved but without the tack sharp focus on the dying bush, it kind of loses something. I''d like to see less of the rocky foreground ame possibly more sky to really give this photo some snap.', '2005-10-05 09:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760639, 239743, 36199, '<td valign="top">a lovely sunset but for me personally, as the blue is very pale the impact of the opposite colours is not strong enough</td>', 'a lovely sunset but for me personally, as the blue is very pale the impact of the opposite colours is not strong enough', '2005-10-05 09:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760645, 239608, 36199, '<td valign="top">i think i would have preferred the lights swapped over in contrast to the background</td>', 'i think i would have preferred the lights swapped over in contrast to the background', '2005-10-05 09:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760646, 240513, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE The three muskateers. I like the simplicity of this. Like the red turned into the green - clever.  Maybe do a selective color (white) adjustment, and get rid of the gray and blue tinge to the background.  The focus is good and the lighting is nice. 8</td>', 'HEE HEE The three muskateers. I like the simplicity of this. Like the red turned into the green - clever.  Maybe do a selective color (white) adjustment, and get rid of the gray and blue tinge to the background.  The focus is good and the lighting is nice. 8', '2005-10-05 09:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760649, 240358, 44743, '<td valign="top">Love the shot! The sweat looks perfect. The uneven floor is slightly distracting, but not a big deal.</td>', 'Love the shot! The sweat looks perfect. The uneven floor is slightly distracting, but not a big deal.', '2005-10-05 09:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760654, 237938, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice close up. The lighting seems a bit off - I''d like the colors to be more vibrant.  Possibly a looser crop with more black area would have worked a bit better.</td>', 'Nice close up. The lighting seems a bit off - I''d like the colors to be more vibrant.  Possibly a looser crop with more black area would have worked a bit better.', '2005-10-05 09:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760659, 239482, 36199, '<td valign="top">too many colours so that any complementary ones to not emerge as prominently as they should.<br/>A nice sharp image well composed</td>', 'too many colours so that any complementary ones to not emerge as prominently as they should.A nice sharp image well composed', '2005-10-05 09:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760661, 237677, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast, but this isn''t complementary.  A minty or lime green would be the complementary color to pink. The crop is nice and the composition is good, but without more of the stem color, it kind of loses something, not visually, but as the proper entry for this challenge.</td>', 'I love the contrast, but this isn''t complementary.  A minty or lime green would be the complementary color to pink. The crop is nice and the composition is good, but without more of the stem color, it kind of loses something, not visually, but as the proper entry for this challenge.', '2005-10-05 09:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760663, 237547, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice geometry. The up shot works well and creates some interesting angles.  The colors are certainly fitting for the challenge.</td>', 'Nice geometry. The up shot works well and creates some interesting angles.  The colors are certainly fitting for the challenge.', '2005-10-05 09:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760665, 239733, 36199, '<td valign="top">a lovely clear sharp image with good composition, although i don''t think the colours are complementary, minus1point</td>', 'a lovely clear sharp image with good composition, although i don''t think the colours are complementary, minus1point', '2005-10-05 09:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760666, 240173, 36499, '<td valign="top">nice idea you were going for here but i would have cropped more on the right side to get her arm out of the photo. her hair is also caught up in the hairbanders on the right and the yellow of the models skin is not very pleasing to look at even tho she is a very pretty model. good composition and focus on the model. good luck :o)</td>', 'nice idea you were going for here but i would have cropped more on the right side to get her arm out of the photo. her hair is also caught up in the hairbanders on the right and the yellow of the models skin is not very pleasing to look at even tho she is a very pretty model. good composition and focus on the model. good luck :o)', '2005-10-05 09:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760667, 238832, 36199, '<td valign="top">very nice a lovely contrast</td>', 'very nice a lovely contrast', '2005-10-05 09:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760670, 240210, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I wish the drapes were a deeper tone, but I guess the beigy peach offsets the pale blue of the right wall. The composition is good and I usually hate toy type props, but the doll with the long dangly legs works here.  Is that a heat register on the floor between the crapes? Hmm - the shadow under it creates a tiny bit of distraction. If that''s a rug on the floor (and not fully layed carpet), I''d roll it back - it appears that there is hardwood, but I can''t gell for sure. I love your imaginative approach, if nothing else. 7</td>', 'Interesting.  I wish the drapes were a deeper tone, but I guess the beigy peach offsets the pale blue of the right wall. The composition is good and I usually hate toy type props, but the doll with the long dangly legs works here.  Is that a heat register on the floor between the crapes? Hmm - the shadow under it creates a tiny bit of distraction. If that''s a rug on the floor (and not fully layed carpet), I''d roll it back - it appears that there is hardwood, but I can''t gell for sure. I love your imaginative approach, if nothing else. 7', '2005-10-05 09:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760672, 240607, 36199, '<td valign="top">i really like this picture, but i don''t think the colours meet the challenge. I like the way the patterns of colour interplay, you don''t need to know what they really are</td>', 'i really like this picture, but i don''t think the colours meet the challenge. I like the way the patterns of colour interplay, you don''t need to know what they really are', '2005-10-05 09:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760675, 240198, 36199, '<td valign="top">nice potrait but not very complementary(colours I mean!!)</td>', 'nice potrait but not very complementary(colours I mean!!)', '2005-10-05 09:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760678, 239139, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this.  Something is lacking and I can''t put my finger on it. Maybe it''s the background. Hmmm. The lighting is good and the diagonal sense of the ribs on the sweaters draws your eyes to the hands.  If this weren''t a complementary photo challenge, I think it would be awesome in black and white.  I''d like to see more negative space on one side - I think the centered placement kind of depletes the impact of it.</td>', 'I love the idea of this.  Something is lacking and I can''t put my finger on it. Maybe it''s the background. Hmmm. The lighting is good and the diagonal sense of the ribs on the sweaters draws your eyes to the hands.  If this weren''t a complementary photo challenge, I think it would be awesome in black and white.  I''d like to see more negative space on one side - I think the centered placement kind of depletes the impact of it.', '2005-10-05 09:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760680, 239751, 36199, '<td valign="top">I feel like the complementary part of the picture fades in significance as your eye is pulled through the foliage to the lovely view beyond.</td>', 'I feel like the complementary part of the picture fades in significance as your eye is pulled through the foliage to the lovely view beyond.', '2005-10-05 09:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
