(1760688, 240043, 36499, '<td valign="top">very pretty model joey...Its wonderful that you found complimentary colors in human form and i like the BG color choice.I would suggest keeping a bottle of visene to get the red out of her eyes if your going to shoot so close but it may be from processing..good luck and hope to see ya at the top again!</td>', 'very pretty model joey...Its wonderful that you found complimentary colors in human form and i like the BG color choice.I would suggest keeping a bottle of visene to get the red out of her eyes if your going to shoot so close but it may be from processing..good luck and hope to see ya at the top again!', '2005-10-05 09:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
