(1760697, 240410, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the originality of this alot.  IT''s spot on clearly focused as well. My only complaint is that the blue isn''t more vivid and contrasting to the red.</td>', 'I like the originality of this alot.  IT''s spot on clearly focused as well. My only complaint is that the blue isn''t more vivid and contrasting to the red.', '2005-10-05 09:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
