(1760724, 239381, 38223, '<td valign="top">Nice. A little bit of curves and a slightly smaller aperture would''ve been really nice.<br/>Nevertheless. It''s a nice shot with good contrast between the colours.. Though the idea of "Complementary colours" isn''t showing that much.<br/>7</td>', 'Nice. A little bit of curves and a slightly smaller aperture would''ve been really nice.Nevertheless. It''s a nice shot with good contrast between the colours.. Though the idea of "Complementary colours" isn''t showing that much.7', '2005-10-05 09:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
