(1760765, 239381, 36981, '<td valign="top">I''ve come back to this several times to try to figure out why I love it so much.   Generally, flora doesn''t really grab me, but this is definitely one of my favorite images of the challenge.  I think it must be the lighting, which is spectacular.</td>', 'I''ve come back to this several times to try to figure out why I love it so much.   Generally, flora doesn''t really grab me, but this is definitely one of my favorite images of the challenge.  I think it must be the lighting, which is spectacular.', '2005-10-05 10:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760766, 239274, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice, looks a little washed out, meets the challenge, could maybe use more contrast. What are all the little spots in the sky? Dirt?</td>', 'Nice, looks a little washed out, meets the challenge, could maybe use more contrast. What are all the little spots in the sky? Dirt?', '2005-10-05 10:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
