(1760773, 240561, 43774, '<td valign="top">Pretty, meets the challenge, blue is nice and bright, orange is a little soft and not entirely in focus.</td>', 'Pretty, meets the challenge, blue is nice and bright, orange is a little soft and not entirely in focus.', '2005-10-05 10:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
