(1760834, 240013, 43774, '<td valign="top">Yes it meets the challenge but it is too soft or out of focus for me.</td>', 'Yes it meets the challenge but it is too soft or out of focus for me.', '2005-10-05 10:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760835, 240226, 36361, '<td valign="top">I think a crop on the right side would help this shot a little, I also would have liked the bottom of the battery showing</td>', 'I think a crop on the right side would help this shot a little, I also would have liked the bottom of the battery showing', '2005-10-05 10:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760836, 240532, 43774, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, harsh lighting (flash) is not really flattering.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, harsh lighting (flash) is not really flattering.', '2005-10-05 10:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760837, 239643, 43774, '<td valign="top">Sort of meets the challenge, I would crop off the bottom dark space.</td>', 'Sort of meets the challenge, I would crop off the bottom dark space.', '2005-10-05 10:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760838, 240227, 43774, '<td valign="top">Pretty, nice composition.</td>', 'Pretty, nice composition.', '2005-10-05 10:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760841, 240105, 36361, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this either more centered or farther to one side to create a rule of thirds.  Also, the ferns tend to make this too busy, just the flowers and blue vase would have been nice.</td>', 'I would like to see this either more centered or farther to one side to create a rule of thirds.  Also, the ferns tend to make this too busy, just the flowers and blue vase would have been nice.', '2005-10-05 10:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760845, 238740, 42332, '<td valign="top">haha, love the title. nice shot.</td>', 'haha, love the title. nice shot.', '2005-10-05 10:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760850, 240416, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. Love the outfit.</td>', 'Interesting picture. Love the outfit.', '2005-10-05 10:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760851, 237469, 42638, '<td valign="top">Neat picture. Hard to see the colors though. Nice shapes.</td>', 'Neat picture. Hard to see the colors though. Nice shapes.', '2005-10-05 10:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760852, 240610, 42638, '<td valign="top">Aww, he''s a cutie. Nice picture.</td>', 'Aww, he''s a cutie. Nice picture.', '2005-10-05 10:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760855, 240291, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation. Kind of torn on the B&amp;W though.</td>', 'Interesting interpretation. Kind of torn on the B&W though.', '2005-10-05 10:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760856, 237512, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, Great picture. Love each expression. Dont see much complementary color though.</td>', 'Wow, Great picture. Love each expression. Dont see much complementary color though.', '2005-10-05 10:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760858, 240457, 43463, '<td valign="top">Nice hue tones on these reds and green. I like how the green chip is standing up to not only be the different color from the crowd but exist in a different dimension from all those who choose just to "lay their chips where they may." My only critiques is that it would have made a stronger impact if you had the green chip fully in the center so that the reds radiate out from the green core like petals of a flower. And it would have been nicer if the red chips in the background were as sharp as those in the foreground - if your camera has a manual adjust (at this stage of the voting I don''t know so I am supposing here with just some friendly advice) you could close down the aperature to get sharper image results in the background and still keep the sharpness in the foreground.</td>', 'Nice hue tones on these reds and green. I like how the green chip is standing up to not only be the different color from the crowd but exist in a different dimension from all those who choose just to "lay their chips where they may." My only critiques is that it would have made a stronger impact if you had the green chip fully in the center so that the reds radiate out from the green core like petals of a flower. And it would have been nicer if the red chips in the background were as sharp as those in the foreground - if your camera has a manual adjust (at this stage of the voting I don''t know so I am supposing here with just some friendly advice) you could close down the aperature to get sharper image results in the background and still keep the sharpness in the foreground.', '2005-10-05 10:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760859, 240385, 43774, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge but is an uninteresting photo</td>', 'Meets the challenge but is an uninteresting photo', '2005-10-05 10:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760860, 240231, 36981, '<td valign="top">I think that this might be a little overexposed for my taste.  I think I''d prefer more contrast between the black &amp; white (but even then I''m afraid it wouldn''t fit the challenge for me).</td>', 'I think that this might be a little overexposed for my taste.  I think I''d prefer more contrast between the black & white (but even then I''m afraid it wouldn''t fit the challenge for me).', '2005-10-05 10:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760861, 239163, 43774, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge but there is too much going on in the photo, not enough emphasis placed on the 2 flowers.</td>', 'Meets the challenge but there is too much going on in the photo, not enough emphasis placed on the 2 flowers.', '2005-10-05 10:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760862, 240139, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, great composition, meets the challenge, Well done.</td>', 'Lovely photo, great composition, meets the challenge, Well done.', '2005-10-05 10:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760863, 240073, 42638, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure with this. seems too dark in some spots and washed in others.</td>', 'Not quite sure with this. seems too dark in some spots and washed in others.', '2005-10-05 10:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760864, 240275, 36981, '<td valign="top">This isn''t an image I would expect to see in this challenge.</td>', 'This isn''t an image I would expect to see in this challenge.', '2005-10-05 10:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760865, 238374, 43774, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, not sure I am fond of the lighting.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, not sure I am fond of the lighting.', '2005-10-05 10:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760866, 239898, 43774, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but boy and ball are not in focus.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but boy and ball are not in focus.', '2005-10-05 10:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760867, 237953, 42638, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. A bit fuzzy. Not really complementary colors.</td>', 'Nice picture. A bit fuzzy. Not really complementary colors.', '2005-10-05 10:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760869, 240192, 43774, '<td valign="top">Pretty, meets the challenge.</td>', 'Pretty, meets the challenge.', '2005-10-05 10:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760870, 239365, 43463, '<td valign="top">Nice yellow and purple hues in this floral shot. My only critique is that the focus could be zoomed in a little more to exclude some of the greenery background. Closer cropping would have focused the eye more strongly on these flowers.</td>', 'Nice yellow and purple hues in this floral shot. My only critique is that the focus could be zoomed in a little more to exclude some of the greenery background. Closer cropping would have focused the eye more strongly on these flowers.', '2005-10-05 10:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760871, 240071, 43774, '<td valign="top">Sort of meets the challenge, maybe if you had concentrated more on the water and beach and cropped off the shoreline and sky the photo would be more interesting.</td>', 'Sort of meets the challenge, maybe if you had concentrated more on the water and beach and cropped off the shoreline and sky the photo would be more interesting.', '2005-10-05 10:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760872, 238172, 43774, '<td valign="top">Blurry, does not meet the challenge.</td>', 'Blurry, does not meet the challenge.', '2005-10-05 10:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760873, 239394, 42638, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape. Cute couple. Interesting interpretation. Don''t see Brown &amp; Blue as complementary as the title suggests but lots of nice orange and Love the blue sky.</td>', 'Nice landscape. Cute couple. Interesting interpretation. Don''t see Brown & Blue as complementary as the title suggests but lots of nice orange and Love the blue sky.', '2005-10-05 10:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760874, 239606, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice, meets the challenge, colours look a little dull, maybe better lighting would help.</td>', 'Nice, meets the challenge, colours look a little dull, maybe better lighting would help.', '2005-10-05 10:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760875, 238251, 36981, '<td valign="top">Unbelievable cloud affects!  I''ve never seen any like this, and will be sure to come back &amp; find out more!</td>', 'Unbelievable cloud affects!  I''ve never seen any like this, and will be sure to come back & find out more!', '2005-10-05 10:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760877, 240304, 43774, '<td valign="top">Does not meet the challenge.</td>', 'Does not meet the challenge.', '2005-10-05 10:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760878, 238845, 36981, '<td valign="top">Lovely &amp; serene.</td>', 'Lovely & serene.', '2005-10-05 10:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760879, 240169, 43774, '<td valign="top">Pretty, better lighting might help.</td>', 'Pretty, better lighting might help.', '2005-10-05 10:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760883, 238172, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. Like the blurred background. Really makes them stand out. Don''t see much on the complementary color though.</td>', 'Interesting picture. Like the blurred background. Really makes them stand out. Don''t see much on the complementary color though.', '2005-10-05 10:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760886, 240081, 43774, '<td valign="top">Sort of meets the challenge, the red is so small you can hardly see it, overshadowed by all the green</td>', 'Sort of meets the challenge, the red is so small you can hardly see it, overshadowed by all the green', '2005-10-05 10:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760887, 240284, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute, meets the challenge, I like the lighting.</td>', 'Cute, meets the challenge, I like the lighting.', '2005-10-05 10:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760888, 239744, 43774, '<td valign="top">Sort of meets the challenge.</td>', 'Sort of meets the challenge.', '2005-10-05 10:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760890, 238170, 43463, '<td valign="top">Interesting arrangement of shapes here to suggest a woman''s body. I like the hues of the purple and yellow. Not to keen on the shadows existing under the lemons for it is a little distracting - perhaps a flashlight beam aimed on the underside and the camera flash would have lessened the deep shadows cast. The purple background while not a solid flat color compliments the yellow of the lemons because the textures on these two objects almost mimic each other.</td>', 'Interesting arrangement of shapes here to suggest a woman''s body. I like the hues of the purple and yellow. Not to keen on the shadows existing under the lemons for it is a little distracting - perhaps a flashlight beam aimed on the underside and the camera flash would have lessened the deep shadows cast. The purple background while not a solid flat color compliments the yellow of the lemons because the textures on these two objects almost mimic each other.', '2005-10-05 10:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760891, 240310, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice, meets the challenge, a lot of dark space at the bottom though.</td>', 'Nice, meets the challenge, a lot of dark space at the bottom though.', '2005-10-05 10:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760893, 240198, 43774, '<td valign="top">Does not meet the challenge</td>', 'Does not meet the challenge', '2005-10-05 10:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760894, 239230, 43774, '<td valign="top">Does not really meet the challenge.</td>', 'Does not really meet the challenge.', '2005-10-05 10:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760905, 238752, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love it!! Meets the challenge, is creative and different. Wonderful composition.</td>', 'Love it!! Meets the challenge, is creative and different. Wonderful composition.', '2005-10-05 10:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760906, 237825, 43774, '<td valign="top">Does not meet the challenge</td>', 'Does not meet the challenge', '2005-10-05 10:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760909, 239624, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice, meets the challenge.</td>', 'Nice, meets the challenge.', '2005-10-05 10:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760910, 240412, 43774, '<td valign="top">Does not meet the challenge.</td>', 'Does not meet the challenge.', '2005-10-05 10:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760911, 238510, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty vivid colors.  This may sound trite, but I wish the rose had water droplets on it.<br/> <br/>The DOF is good and the light and shadow of the rose petals create effective texture.</td>', 'Pretty vivid colors.  This may sound trite, but I wish the rose had water droplets on it. The DOF is good and the light and shadow of the rose petals create effective texture.', '2005-10-05 10:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760913, 240457, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice! Creative, meets the challenge.</td>', 'Nice! Creative, meets the challenge.', '2005-10-05 10:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760915, 237547, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice work, meets the challenge.</td>', 'Nice work, meets the challenge.', '2005-10-05 10:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760916, 238408, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice, meets the challenge</td>', 'Very nice, meets the challenge', '2005-10-05 10:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760917, 240232, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2005-10-05 10:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760918, 237512, 43774, '<td valign="top">Does not meet the challenge.</td>', 'Does not meet the challenge.', '2005-10-05 10:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760920, 240186, 15711, '<td valign="top">I would love for this to be on a solid black background and in tack sharp focus, as the blossom has the complementary colors and is very striking.</td>', 'I would love for this to be on a solid black background and in tack sharp focus, as the blossom has the complementary colors and is very striking.', '2005-10-05 10:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760924, 239392, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice, excellent composition, meets the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice, excellent composition, meets the challenge.', '2005-10-05 10:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760925, 237856, 43774, '<td valign="top">Does not meet the challenge. Neat photo though, too bad.</td>', 'Does not meet the challenge. Neat photo though, too bad.', '2005-10-05 10:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760926, 237710, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like the hues of the blue and oranges as well as the arrangement of objects. The only thing that is really detracting from an overall appealling image is those deep shadows on the oragami crane and upper left hand corner. Perhaps a light source directed from below the crane as well as camera flash would significantly eliminate those deep shadows.</td>', 'I like the hues of the blue and oranges as well as the arrangement of objects. The only thing that is really detracting from an overall appealling image is those deep shadows on the oragami crane and upper left hand corner. Perhaps a light source directed from below the crane as well as camera flash would significantly eliminate those deep shadows.', '2005-10-05 10:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760927, 240275, 43774, '<td valign="top">Does not meet the challenge</td>', 'Does not meet the challenge', '2005-10-05 10:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760933, 239734, 43774, '<td valign="top">I think better lighting would really enhance this photo. I like the composition but I think a perfectly clean white background would do wonders.</td>', 'I think better lighting would really enhance this photo. I like the composition but I think a perfectly clean white background would do wonders.', '2005-10-05 10:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760935, 238435, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing complementary colors.  The opposite of this peachy orange would be some shade of blue and I''m not finding it in this photograph.  The flamingo is a nicely posed bird, but I think since the challenge specifically called for colors that were opposite one onother, this lacks in that regard.</td>', 'I''m not seeing complementary colors.  The opposite of this peachy orange would be some shade of blue and I''m not finding it in this photograph.  The flamingo is a nicely posed bird, but I think since the challenge specifically called for colors that were opposite one onother, this lacks in that regard.', '2005-10-05 10:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
