(1760964, 240270, 43463, '<td valign="top">At first I was going to say that there are too many colors here when the title of this piece and the pairing of some of the bottles struck me. Very clever! Yellow is missing is paired complementary partner purple. Lovely idea on the composition, however the execution calls for some improvement to really make this image "pop" off the page. The colors on the blue and orange bottles are perfect they are both vibrant and the hue shades compliment each other well. However the red bottle and green bottle pairing doesn''t work quite as well. The green bottle is a shade too pale standing next to the vibrant deep red bottle. A richer green hue would have been a better pairing for that red bottle. Next I don''t know why you include thos black rocks for they do nothing for the composition - in fact they detract the eyes attention  from the main focus which are the bottles. Lastly the black background needed to be a deeper, flat and darker hue (there are variations in the black hues such that some ''highlights" appear in the cloth) so that it would make the color hues of these bottles literally "pop" off the page.</td>', 'At first I was going to say that there are too many colors here when the title of this piece and the pairing of some of the bottles struck me. Very clever! Yellow is missing is paired complementary partner purple. Lovely idea on the composition, however the execution calls for some improvement to really make this image "pop" off the page. The colors on the blue and orange bottles are perfect they are both vibrant and the hue shades compliment each other well. However the red bottle and green bottle pairing doesn''t work quite as well. The green bottle is a shade too pale standing next to the vibrant deep red bottle. A richer green hue would have been a better pairing for that red bottle. Next I don''t know why you include thos black rocks for they do nothing for the composition - in fact they detract the eyes attention  from the main focus which are the bottles. Lastly the black background needed to be a deeper, flat and darker hue (there are variations in the black hues such that some ''highlights" appear in the cloth) so that it would make the color hues of these bottles literally "pop" off the page.', '2005-10-05 10:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760966, 240013, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this but it needs to be tack sharp to be an effective macro. The colors are wonderful and the detail could be great and textural, but back to the focus - it''s just not there. ;~(</td>', 'I love the idea of this but it needs to be tack sharp to be an effective macro. The colors are wonderful and the detail could be great and textural, but back to the focus - it''s just not there. ;~(', '2005-10-05 10:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760967, 239501, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2005-10-05 10:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760968, 240242, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the tack sharp focus.  I wish there were more purple visible.</td>', 'Love the tack sharp focus.  I wish there were more purple visible.', '2005-10-05 10:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760973, 238590, 43774, '<td valign="top">Photo looks to be tilted a lot to the right, that''s distracting.</td>', 'Photo looks to be tilted a lot to the right, that''s distracting.', '2005-10-05 10:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760974, 239809, 15711, '<td valign="top">NOt crazy about the long wordy title, but the colors work.  I sense that it is slightly out of focus.  The DOF is good but without tack sharp clarity, it kind of loses the impact.</td>', 'NOt crazy about the long wordy title, but the colors work.  I sense that it is slightly out of focus.  The DOF is good but without tack sharp clarity, it kind of loses the impact.', '2005-10-05 10:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760978, 240291, 15711, '<td valign="top">Black and white are not complementary colors.  They are contrasting, but not colors at all. This would be effective (despite the "does not meet the challenge") if it were tack sharp and there were more negative space to one side of the foot/shoe.</td>', 'Black and white are not complementary colors.  They are contrasting, but not colors at all. This would be effective (despite the "does not meet the challenge") if it were tack sharp and there were more negative space to one side of the foot/shoe.', '2005-10-05 10:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760979, 238926, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is really cool....did you actually manage to fill the lightbulbs with coloured water? Very creative.</td>', 'This is really cool....did you actually manage to fill the lightbulbs with coloured water? Very creative.', '2005-10-05 10:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760981, 237856, 43463, '<td valign="top">Whoa! The colors really pop off the page and grab the viewer by the lapels:-) Nice composition of objects and the hues of the magenta almost appear as a neon hue to compliment the greens of the fauna. Only real critique on the image itself is that the leaves on the far left are a tad too overexposed due to the light source being really strong on that side.</td>', 'Whoa! The colors really pop off the page and grab the viewer by the lapels:-) Nice composition of objects and the hues of the magenta almost appear as a neon hue to compliment the greens of the fauna. Only real critique on the image itself is that the leaves on the far left are a tad too overexposed due to the light source being really strong on that side.', '2005-10-05 10:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760984, 239393, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. I like the hardness of the wood against the billowy clouds.</td>', 'Great perspective. I like the hardness of the wood against the billowy clouds.', '2005-10-05 10:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760989, 238556, 15711, '<td valign="top">This seems way over saturated and overexposed. The focus could use a tad of work as well. It does suit the challenge, but the overall effectiveness gets lost with the other things missing.</td>', 'This seems way over saturated and overexposed. The focus could use a tad of work as well. It does suit the challenge, but the overall effectiveness gets lost with the other things missing.', '2005-10-05 10:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760991, 239348, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cool!!!</td>', 'Cool!!!', '2005-10-05 10:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760992, 240173, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2005-10-05 10:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760993, 238183, 15711, '<td valign="top">Where are the contrasting colors? Black and white are not true colors.  The shot is way too small to work effectively. I''d make sure the dimensions are 640 pixels at the highest point and it will create a larger image. This would work better in true black and white with high contrast, but not in this challange.</td>', 'Where are the contrasting colors? Black and white are not true colors.  The shot is way too small to work effectively. I''d make sure the dimensions are 640 pixels at the highest point and it will create a larger image. This would work better in true black and white with high contrast, but not in this challange.', '2005-10-05 10:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1760995, 238244, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I love the textural variations.  It suites the challange and is very eye appealing.</td>', 'Very pretty. I love the textural variations.  It suites the challange and is very eye appealing.', '2005-10-05 10:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761000, 240561, 43463, '<td valign="top">Strong focus on the petals of two different flowers. Complementary colors of blue paired with the orange/yellow is vibrant and rich in tones. Love the textures seen on the petals of both flowers for it gives the eye an added interest to look at. I was going to say that I would have prefered the two flowers to have been of the same kind so that the imagery of them being paired complementary colors would be stronger, but I do think this choice works. The reason? Different colors found in differnt flowers with different textures in the petals adds interest</td>', 'Strong focus on the petals of two different flowers. Complementary colors of blue paired with the orange/yellow is vibrant and rich in tones. Love the textures seen on the petals of both flowers for it gives the eye an added interest to look at. I was going to say that I would have prefered the two flowers to have been of the same kind so that the imagery of them being paired complementary colors would be stronger, but I do think this choice works. The reason? Different colors found in differnt flowers with different textures in the petals adds interest', '2005-10-05 10:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761001, 239895, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the poses of the guy and girl.  This is interesting and imaginative. Thanks for not using a leaf or sunset. LOL</td>', 'I love the poses of the guy and girl.  This is interesting and imaginative. Thanks for not using a leaf or sunset. LOL', '2005-10-05 11:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761008, 239814, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this is imaginative and I like the overall perspective and the title rocks.  I have one small request - go iron the sweater. ROFL<br/> <br/>Good one. 9</td>', 'I think this is imaginative and I like the overall perspective and the title rocks.  I have one small request - go iron the sweater. ROFL Good one. 9', '2005-10-05 11:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761017, 240354, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2005-10-05 11:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761023, 239504, 15711, '<td valign="top">The simplicity is excellent. I love the detail. I''d do a selective color adjustment on the white background to remove the black and cyan. Other than that - spot on.</td>', 'The simplicity is excellent. I love the detail. I''d do a selective color adjustment on the white background to remove the black and cyan. Other than that - spot on.', '2005-10-05 11:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761024, 240591, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the fun and playful creativity seen in this composition!!!!! The orange and blue hues of the paint from the tipped cans is vibrant and bold and that sheen on the paint just really helps to draw the eye to the colors. Love the personification of the paint brushes that are "running" away from their paint containers. Their little "feet" (love how you split the brushes to show that they have legs) leave a paint trail behind them. My only critique is that I wish the black paper background and "floor" where a deeper black to really make the color hues of orange and blue pop off the page.</td>', 'Love the fun and playful creativity seen in this composition!!!!! The orange and blue hues of the paint from the tipped cans is vibrant and bold and that sheen on the paint just really helps to draw the eye to the colors. Love the personification of the paint brushes that are "running" away from their paint containers. Their little "feet" (love how you split the brushes to show that they have legs) leave a paint trail behind them. My only critique is that I wish the black paper background and "floor" where a deeper black to really make the color hues of orange and blue pop off the page.', '2005-10-05 11:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761026, 240604, 33542, '<td valign="top">there''s a lot of white noise on this photo... did you oversharpen or something?</td>', 'there''s a lot of white noise on this photo... did you oversharpen or something?', '2005-10-05 11:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761028, 237531, 15711, '<td valign="top">This dog has captivating eyes and the colors certainly suit the challenge.  I love his pose. The composition is spot on.  Great DOF. Mine would''ve jumped off the couch and would be licking me.  What a nice model. hee hee</td>', 'This dog has captivating eyes and the colors certainly suit the challenge.  I love his pose. The composition is spot on.  Great DOF. Mine would''ve jumped off the couch and would be licking me.  What a nice model. hee hee', '2005-10-05 11:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761029, 240231, 33542, '<td valign="top">there''s a white haze over the photo and it looks washed ou tin general</td>', 'there''s a white haze over the photo and it looks washed ou tin general', '2005-10-05 11:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761035, 239392, 15711, '<td valign="top">I didn''t comment on this until I came back for a second review.  Not only did I up the score but the more I look at it, the better it is.  This would make an awesome print. The frame of the old rotting wood is great. The light bouncing off of the pear on the right pear is a nice touch.  The glow of the other two really makes for interesting appeal. It is quite artfully done. The use of negative space is spot on. 10</td>', 'I didn''t comment on this until I came back for a second review.  Not only did I up the score but the more I look at it, the better it is.  This would make an awesome print. The frame of the old rotting wood is great. The light bouncing off of the pear on the right pear is a nice touch.  The glow of the other two really makes for interesting appeal. It is quite artfully done. The use of negative space is spot on. 10', '2005-10-05 11:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761039, 239392, 43463, '<td valign="top">Colors, composition, and objects are lovely and interesting to look at. I like that you have the three pairs resting on a old window wood frame - the texture of the wood adds additional interest to this "Still Life" capture. Lighting is very good on the main subjects. My only critique is that there is to much ''blank space'' floating around the main subject of focus. Cutting down that ''empty'' black space by say half to get a  closer crop or zoom in on the three pears would have improved the overall image.</td>', 'Colors, composition, and objects are lovely and interesting to look at. I like that you have the three pairs resting on a old window wood frame - the texture of the wood adds additional interest to this "Still Life" capture. Lighting is very good on the main subjects. My only critique is that there is to much ''blank space'' floating around the main subject of focus. Cutting down that ''empty'' black space by say half to get a  closer crop or zoom in on the three pears would have improved the overall image.', '2005-10-05 11:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761040, 238932, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is very artfully done.  Interesting and the horizontal sense of it moves the eye from lower left to upper right. Great lighting as well.</td>', 'This is very artfully done.  Interesting and the horizontal sense of it moves the eye from lower left to upper right. Great lighting as well.', '2005-10-05 11:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761043, 238926, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.  My only critique would be to allow more negative space so that they aren''t so dead center in the shot. Good light and clarity. 8</td>', 'I like this alot.  My only critique would be to allow more negative space so that they aren''t so dead center in the shot. Good light and clarity. 8', '2005-10-05 11:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761045, 238451, 36499, '<td valign="top">the darker greens show alot of noise(neat image or noisewarewouldve helped this) great shot and good luck</td>', 'the darker greens show alot of noise(neat image or noisewarewouldve helped this) great shot and good luck', '2005-10-05 11:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761052, 238932, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wow! Lighting on the subject is soft and perfect. Love shadows that compliment the orange vase and the tulip. The hues are beautiful and vibrant. The eye is immediately captivated with the imagery and the colors hold our attention. Very nicely done!</td>', 'Wow! Lighting on the subject is soft and perfect. Love shadows that compliment the orange vase and the tulip. The hues are beautiful and vibrant. The eye is immediately captivated with the imagery and the colors hold our attention. Very nicely done!', '2005-10-05 11:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761056, 240231, 36499, '<td valign="top">great composition and focus a bit of levels and contrast wouldve made this photo not so hazy looking. and selective color(white) wouldve made your whites real white and the black selective color wouldve ade the blacks true...good luck, hope this helps :o) Cher</td>', 'great composition and focus a bit of levels and contrast wouldve made this photo not so hazy looking. and selective color(white) wouldve made your whites real white and the black selective color wouldve ade the blacks true...good luck, hope this helps :o) Cher', '2005-10-05 11:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761057, 240284, 41521, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, shadows are a bit distracting.</td>', 'Cute idea, shadows are a bit distracting.', '2005-10-05 11:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761067, 240591, 36499, '<td valign="top">hee hee...i love the fun feel of this photo..great work..only nit pick is to watch your stick on the blue brush...again great work</td>', 'hee hee...i love the fun feel of this photo..great work..only nit pick is to watch your stick on the blue brush...again great work', '2005-10-05 11:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761070, 240242, 41521, '<td valign="top">Would like to see more of the purple here.  Cute chick!</td>', 'Would like to see more of the purple here.  Cute chick!', '2005-10-05 11:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761077, 240354, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the title on this piece. Very creative arrangement of complementary colors. The deep purple spool of thread is in the center and that object/color is the first thing to capture the eyes attention. We then radiate out from the center to notice the yellows and pale violet hues surrounding the center subject. I like the addition of the measuring tape for it just helps to strenthens the imagery of sewing not to mention it is also the color compliment to purple. Hmmm, I wonder if the addition of a sewing needle would have added to the invoked imagery of sewing - given the arrangement of objects it is not necessary but it might have been a nice compliment. My only other critique is that you might have cropped out a little more of the right hand portion to eliminate that unappealing  beige background that appears in the top right hand corner.</td>', 'Love the title on this piece. Very creative arrangement of complementary colors. The deep purple spool of thread is in the center and that object/color is the first thing to capture the eyes attention. We then radiate out from the center to notice the yellows and pale violet hues surrounding the center subject. I like the addition of the measuring tape for it just helps to strenthens the imagery of sewing not to mention it is also the color compliment to purple. Hmmm, I wonder if the addition of a sewing needle would have added to the invoked imagery of sewing - given the arrangement of objects it is not necessary but it might have been a nice compliment. My only other critique is that you might have cropped out a little more of the right hand portion to eliminate that unappealing  beige background that appears in the top right hand corner.', '2005-10-05 11:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1761080, 240408, 41521, '<td valign="top">Colors are great, focus seems off to me.</td>', 'Colors are great, focus seems off to me.', '2005-10-05 11:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
