(1761337, 239601, 43565, '<td valign="top">I guess the purple and yellow are complimentary, but I had to look too hard to find it.  I do not find the subject interesting.</td>', 'I guess the purple and yellow are complimentary, but I had to look too hard to find it.  I do not find the subject interesting.', '2005-10-05 12:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
