(1762352, 238499, 6132, '<td valign="top">Now this is my kind of image, gritty, urban and in your face. No doubt whatsoever about it meeting the challenge. Composition seems good although I would have personally had the green mailbox more to the left of the image.*Shrugs Shoulders* Maybe this was something that couldn''t be helped.  Gets an 8 from me. Good luck</td>', 'Now this is my kind of image, gritty, urban and in your face. No doubt whatsoever about it meeting the challenge. Composition seems good although I would have personally had the green mailbox more to the left of the image.*Shrugs Shoulders* Maybe this was something that couldn''t be helped.  Gets an 8 from me. Good luck', '2005-10-05 17:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762356, 240291, 38223, '<td valign="top">Complimentary colours, anyone?. Nevertheless an interesting shot. <br/>Off-topic: With a stop hi</td>', 'Complimentary colours, anyone?. Nevertheless an interesting shot. Off-topic: With a stop hi', '2005-10-05 17:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762358, 239684, 43565, '<td valign="top">There are no complementary colors and I think the scooter should be in focus.</td>', 'There are no complementary colors and I think the scooter should be in focus.', '2005-10-05 17:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762363, 238172, 43565, '<td valign="top">There are no complementarty colors.</td>', 'There are no complementarty colors.', '2005-10-05 17:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762364, 240007, 38223, '<td valign="top">Oh, for crying out loud.. Any change of a challenge WITHOUT bug macros? :D<br/>Nevertheless a great shot.</td>', 'Oh, for crying out loud.. Any change of a challenge WITHOUT bug macros? :DNevertheless a great shot.', '2005-10-05 17:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762367, 240576, 43565, '<td valign="top">Brown I guess.</td>', 'Brown I guess.', '2005-10-05 17:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762369, 240073, 38223, '<td valign="top">"Colour" is such an overrated word</td>', '"Colour" is such an overrated word', '2005-10-05 17:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762372, 240484, 6132, '<td valign="top">Can I guess what this is? Looks to me like a chair :)  Fits the challenge perfectly, nice vibrant colours. 8</td>', 'Can I guess what this is? Looks to me like a chair :)  Fits the challenge perfectly, nice vibrant colours. 8', '2005-10-05 17:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762373, 239743, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen the gray in the sky more blue.</td>', 'I would like to have seen the gray in the sky more blue.', '2005-10-05 17:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762376, 239937, 6132, '<td valign="top">A very nice image indeed. It''s a shame that the sky couldn''t have worked out more better for you.  Gets an 8 from me.</td>', 'A very nice image indeed. It''s a shame that the sky couldn''t have worked out more better for you.  Gets an 8 from me.', '2005-10-05 17:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762380, 240493, 43565, '<td valign="top">Yellow/purple, blue/orange not blue-yellow.</td>', 'Yellow/purple, blue/orange not blue-yellow.', '2005-10-05 17:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762383, 240134, 6132, '<td valign="top">An original entry for this challenge. A good find. 8</td>', 'An original entry for this challenge. A good find. 8', '2005-10-05 17:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762386, 238453, 43565, '<td valign="top">Hope you were for the blue!</td>', 'Hope you were for the blue!', '2005-10-05 17:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762389, 239392, 6132, '<td valign="top">Very professional looking. 10</td>', 'Very professional looking. 10', '2005-10-05 17:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762392, 237547, 6132, '<td valign="top">A very nice image, good composition.</td>', 'A very nice image, good composition.', '2005-10-05 17:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762393, 240270, 43565, '<td valign="top">Poor purple!  I like this a lot.</td>', 'Poor purple!  I like this a lot.', '2005-10-05 17:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762398, 239610, 43565, '<td valign="top">I wish more of the yellow was showing, and that the reflection was not cut off.</td>', 'I wish more of the yellow was showing, and that the reflection was not cut off.', '2005-10-05 17:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762409, 240505, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would like this better showing more of the peppers and without the white.  Or malybe if they were angled.</td>', 'I would like this better showing more of the peppers and without the white.  Or malybe if they were angled.', '2005-10-05 17:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762417, 240551, 43753, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and sharp image. Breat background. Creative composition. Nice representation of red and green complementary colors.</td>', 'Very crisp and sharp image. Breat background. Creative composition. Nice representation of red and green complementary colors.', '2005-10-05 17:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762418, 240173, 43753, '<td valign="top">Beautiful representation of complementary purple and yellow. I like the way you use your colors to frame the image. The subjects purple eye-shadow and yellow skin tones add more impact.</td>', 'Beautiful representation of complementary purple and yellow. I like the way you use your colors to frame the image. The subjects purple eye-shadow and yellow skin tones add more impact.', '2005-10-05 17:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762420, 239812, 43753, '<td valign="top">Wonderful macro, and excellent representation of complementary colors. Colors are bright and crisp. Excellent detail.</td>', 'Wonderful macro, and excellent representation of complementary colors. Colors are bright and crisp. Excellent detail.', '2005-10-05 17:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762421, 238752, 43753, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Your composition, lighting, focus, color - A++++ Complementary colors are very clear to me.</td>', 'Excellent shot. Your composition, lighting, focus, color - A++++ Complementary colors are very clear to me.', '2005-10-05 17:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762427, 239964, 43753, '<td valign="top">Nice dark background - srisp image. Good representation of red and green complementary colors.</td>', 'Nice dark background - srisp image. Good representation of red and green complementary colors.', '2005-10-05 17:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762428, 239156, 43753, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Your complementary colors are very clear. I like the positioning of your subject, and I really like the diagonal line across the frame. I personally like the shadow too. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Your complementary colors are very clear. I like the positioning of your subject, and I really like the diagonal line across the frame. I personally like the shadow too. Well done.', '2005-10-05 17:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762430, 240232, 43753, '<td valign="top">Great use of complementart Red &amp; Green. Nice compostition. Love the black hair over the shoulder. Very clean image.</td>', 'Great use of complementart Red & Green. Nice compostition. Love the black hair over the shoulder. Very clean image.', '2005-10-05 17:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762431, 239745, 24991, '<td valign="top">Blue and Gray? Nope</td>', 'Blue and Gray? Nope', '2005-10-05 17:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762432, 240193, 43753, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and good representation of complementary yellow and purple. It seems a little off balance to me.</td>', 'Very pretty and good representation of complementary yellow and purple. It seems a little off balance to me.', '2005-10-05 17:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762434, 239139, 43753, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and the green and red sweater is showing complementary colors. I would like to see more sweater and the joined hands a little closer to the middle of the frame. In this case, symmetry is more important. Touching photograph.</td>', 'I like the idea, and the green and red sweater is showing complementary colors. I would like to see more sweater and the joined hands a little closer to the middle of the frame. In this case, symmetry is more important. Touching photograph.', '2005-10-05 17:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762435, 240139, 24991, '<td valign="top">Would be nice to see more of the reflection of the leaves.</td>', 'Would be nice to see more of the reflection of the leaves.', '2005-10-05 17:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762438, 240542, 43753, '<td valign="top">You had to include the red in there? The image would have been a lot more effective had you kept with the orange shirt and blue cords. You have enough texture in these two garments without introducing a third that throws off the balance between the complementary colors.</td>', 'You had to include the red in there? The image would have been a lot more effective had you kept with the orange shirt and blue cords. You have enough texture in these two garments without introducing a third that throws off the balance between the complementary colors.', '2005-10-05 17:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762443, 239937, 43753, '<td valign="top">The image contains red and green, but the overall representation of complementary colors is missing. There is a lot of clutter in the lower right corner of frame - this is a bit distracting. If you moved around enough to get the clutter out of the corner and the black out of the left center, the image would be more streamlined. Very colorful and bright.</td>', 'The image contains red and green, but the overall representation of complementary colors is missing. There is a lot of clutter in the lower right corner of frame - this is a bit distracting. If you moved around enough to get the clutter out of the corner and the black out of the left center, the image would be more streamlined. Very colorful and bright.', '2005-10-05 17:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762445, 237512, 43681, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo , but out of argument !</td>', 'Very nice photo , but out of argument !', '2005-10-05 17:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762447, 239654, 43753, '<td valign="top">I like the comp, but it lacks impact. It may be too soft. It doesn''t really pop. Olive and magenta - interesting take on complementary colors.</td>', 'I like the comp, but it lacks impact. It may be too soft. It doesn''t really pop. Olive and magenta - interesting take on complementary colors.', '2005-10-05 17:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762449, 240225, 43753, '<td valign="top">Too little blue to complement the orange, and the subject is too centered. O ;ike the textures though.</td>', 'Too little blue to complement the orange, and the subject is too centered. O ;ike the textures though.', '2005-10-05 17:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762452, 239393, 43753, '<td valign="top">This interpretation of complementary colors is a bit too lose for my taste. I can see a little orange tone in the wood to complement to blue, but it doesn''t stand out enough. This is a beautiful shot thoug. The angel and perspective really move the compositon. The image is very clear and sharp, and the detail is great. It just doesn''t display strong complementary colors.</td>', 'This interpretation of complementary colors is a bit too lose for my taste. I can see a little orange tone in the wood to complement to blue, but it doesn''t stand out enough. This is a beautiful shot thoug. The angel and perspective really move the compositon. The image is very clear and sharp, and the detail is great. It just doesn''t display strong complementary colors.', '2005-10-05 17:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762455, 237962, 43753, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t show complementary colors. You should have used green apples. Such a great comp.</td>', 'This doesn''t show complementary colors. You should have used green apples. Such a great comp.', '2005-10-05 17:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762457, 239655, 43753, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any complementary colors here, but the macro shot is beautiful with lots of detail and texture.</td>', 'I don''t see any complementary colors here, but the macro shot is beautiful with lots of detail and texture.', '2005-10-05 17:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762458, 240608, 43753, '<td valign="top">Don''t see any complementary colors here, but the image is well executed. Very clear and interesting.</td>', 'Don''t see any complementary colors here, but the image is well executed. Very clear and interesting.', '2005-10-05 17:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762461, 240454, 43753, '<td valign="top">I can''t see any complementary colors in this, and I am having a difficult time understanding what I am looking at. If abstract is what you are going for, you have succeeded. I do like the shades of red, orange, and yellow. This would make a great fine art print.</td>', 'I can''t see any complementary colors in this, and I am having a difficult time understanding what I am looking at. If abstract is what you are going for, you have succeeded. I do like the shades of red, orange, and yellow. This would make a great fine art print.', '2005-10-05 17:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762463, 240412, 43753, '<td valign="top">Red and blue aren''t complementary. This is a beautiful shot. Well executed. Just doesn''t meet challenge.</td>', 'Red and blue aren''t complementary. This is a beautiful shot. Well executed. Just doesn''t meet challenge.', '2005-10-05 17:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1762465, 238077, 43753, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro, but the complementary colors are too subtle. Green/Red. I do see a tiny bit of green towards the petals join in the center of the flower, and I do see the red. It just doesn''t complement enough to draw interest away from the yellow.</td>', 'Beautiful macro, but the complementary colors are too subtle. Green/Red. I do see a tiny bit of green towards the petals join in the center of the flower, and I do see the red. It just doesn''t complement enough to draw interest away from the yellow.', '2005-10-05 17:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
