(1762806, 239937, 43463, '<td valign="top">Too many shapes and colors here in the composition that the true pairing of complentary colors gets lost in this bold and vibrant composition. Yes, the colors are bold and beautiful and attract the eye, but I think it could have been stronger if you focused on a central area that also plays up the shapes one sees here. I.E. centering on green wall and red/violent stairs would not only have been an abstract showing bold colors but also bold and clearly defined shapes with interesting angles.</td>', 'Too many shapes and colors here in the composition that the true pairing of complentary colors gets lost in this bold and vibrant composition. Yes, the colors are bold and beautiful and attract the eye, but I think it could have been stronger if you focused on a central area that also plays up the shapes one sees here. I.E. centering on green wall and red/violent stairs would not only have been an abstract showing bold colors but also bold and clearly defined shapes with interesting angles.', '2005-10-05 20:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
