(1764158, 239348, 44963, '<td valign="top">This is an image that draws the eye.  The colour, of course, dominates but I was then attracted to the detail of the right hand as opposed to the shadow and shade of the left.  The title is very apt.  I wonder what the affect would be if the left hand - dark colour - had been photographed in the foreground?  Great shot.  I like it.</td>', 'This is an image that draws the eye.  The colour, of course, dominates but I was then attracted to the detail of the right hand as opposed to the shadow and shade of the left.  The title is very apt.  I wonder what the affect would be if the left hand - dark colour - had been photographed in the foreground?  Great shot.  I like it.', '2005-10-06 07:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
