(1764346, 240591, 16636, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the background you have used and the burnout on top of the tins, but what a superb interpretation of the theme - good luck.</td>', 'Not sure about the background you have used and the burnout on top of the tins, but what a superb interpretation of the theme - good luck.', '2005-10-06 10:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764348, 240379, 16636, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you have quite got the exposure right on the plant, but certainly meets the challenge subject!</td>', 'I don''t think you have quite got the exposure right on the plant, but certainly meets the challenge subject!', '2005-10-06 10:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764365, 240578, 32117, '<td valign="top">Its fire in the sky honey!!!!</td>', 'Its fire in the sky honey!!!!', '2005-10-06 10:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764371, 240537, 43463, '<td valign="top">Composition could have been improved if there was more red injected into the picture. The pose is just fine, that I would definately keep. But with the green apple you really needed to play up the complementary color of red and that could have been done with a red dress/shirt, red lipstick, and nails painted a deep red color -thus it would invoke not only the imagery associated with the eating of the apple at Eden but also the apple that Snow White ate (only with an inverse in color since the apple was red - different but still good to be a little different in approach since the color green symbolizes spring/fertility/renewal).</td>', 'Composition could have been improved if there was more red injected into the picture. The pose is just fine, that I would definately keep. But with the green apple you really needed to play up the complementary color of red and that could have been done with a red dress/shirt, red lipstick, and nails painted a deep red color -thus it would invoke not only the imagery associated with the eating of the apple at Eden but also the apple that Snow White ate (only with an inverse in color since the apple was red - different but still good to be a little different in approach since the color green symbolizes spring/fertility/renewal).', '2005-10-06 10:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764377, 239644, 44860, '<td valign="top">No, it''s not. Interesting anyway.</td>', 'No, it''s not. Interesting anyway.', '2005-10-06 10:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764380, 238556, 44860, '<td valign="top">Oversaturated red, loss of details in blossom.</td>', 'Oversaturated red, loss of details in blossom.', '2005-10-06 10:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764386, 239951, 44860, '<td valign="top">It''s quite close to color circle!</td>', 'It''s quite close to color circle!', '2005-10-06 10:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764390, 238172, 44860, '<td valign="top">This photo does not belong to the challenge. Emotionaly interesting.</td>', 'This photo does not belong to the challenge. Emotionaly interesting.', '2005-10-06 10:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764408, 240591, 29474, '<td valign="top">That''ll teach you to leave them standing in the paint with wet feet. Wonderful idea. Well executed. A pity that the blue footsteps are obscured. Is that a nail/pin that I see holding blue.</td>', 'That''ll teach you to leave them standing in the paint with wet feet. Wonderful idea. Well executed. A pity that the blue footsteps are obscured. Is that a nail/pin that I see holding blue.', '2005-10-06 10:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764411, 239734, 44860, '<td valign="top">Pleasant lighting.</td>', 'Pleasant lighting.', '2005-10-06 10:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764416, 238374, 43463, '<td valign="top">A solid deep black background and floor plane would have really made the colors pop off the page. As it is here the background and floor plane are a dull grey/black. A more complementary lighting set-up would have illuminated the colors better - I see a single light source shining from above that washes out some of the colors on the leaves causing too much glare and causing a deep shadow on the floor.</td>', 'A solid deep black background and floor plane would have really made the colors pop off the page. As it is here the background and floor plane are a dull grey/black. A more complementary lighting set-up would have illuminated the colors better - I see a single light source shining from above that washes out some of the colors on the leaves causing too much glare and causing a deep shadow on the floor.', '2005-10-06 10:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764418, 239567, 34759, '<td valign="top">Would be better if the colors had been more vibrant with more of a bright red than a rust color.</td>', 'Would be better if the colors had been more vibrant with more of a bright red than a rust color.', '2005-10-06 10:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764421, 238838, 34759, '<td valign="top">Nice. Great sharpness and texture in the one leaf.</td>', 'Nice. Great sharpness and texture in the one leaf.', '2005-10-06 10:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764424, 239482, 29474, '<td valign="top">Colourful and brochure like, but not close enough to the challenge for me. It is a pity that the top of the ''device'' is cropped off.</td>', 'Colourful and brochure like, but not close enough to the challenge for me. It is a pity that the top of the ''device'' is cropped off.', '2005-10-06 10:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764425, 238556, 43463, '<td valign="top">Colors fit the criteria however the colors of red and green are bathed in the harsh light of the early afternoon sun. A very late afternoon or early evening shot would have bathed the subjects in a "warm" light and brought out some warm rich tones not to mention possibly eliminate that shadow cast by the flower onto the green leaf.</td>', 'Colors fit the criteria however the colors of red and green are bathed in the harsh light of the early afternoon sun. A very late afternoon or early evening shot would have bathed the subjects in a "warm" light and brought out some warm rich tones not to mention possibly eliminate that shadow cast by the flower onto the green leaf.', '2005-10-06 10:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764426, 240275, 29474, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Well spotted. But definitely not applicable to this challenge. There is not one subject of interest that draws the eye. The shadows are distracting.</td>', 'Interesting idea. Well spotted. But definitely not applicable to this challenge. There is not one subject of interest that draws the eye. The shadows are distracting.', '2005-10-06 10:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764430, 238074, 43463, '<td valign="top">The composition could be improved if you cut down on the "empty space". There is too much white space that the strawberry is just swimming in it. You want to draw the eye directly to the main focus immediately so a closer zoom or crop showing the strawberry would have been better. Light sources from two sides top left diagonal and bottom right diagonal may have eliminated the deep shadow that detracts from the strawberry. Lastly, I would have chosen a better strawberry with a more vibrant green stem - the stem here is a flat dull green/brown that is a very unappealing compliment to the vibrant red of the strawberry.</td>', 'The composition could be improved if you cut down on the "empty space". There is too much white space that the strawberry is just swimming in it. You want to draw the eye directly to the main focus immediately so a closer zoom or crop showing the strawberry would have been better. Light sources from two sides top left diagonal and bottom right diagonal may have eliminated the deep shadow that detracts from the strawberry. Lastly, I would have chosen a better strawberry with a more vibrant green stem - the stem here is a flat dull green/brown that is a very unappealing compliment to the vibrant red of the strawberry.', '2005-10-06 10:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764433, 240105, 24951, '<td valign="top">Not sure it needed the border -especially not that wide.</td>', 'Not sure it needed the border -especially not that wide.', '2005-10-06 10:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764438, 240375, 33515, '<td valign="top">Very nice and clean. The white reflections in the bowl detract some but overall very good.</td>', 'Very nice and clean. The white reflections in the bowl detract some but overall very good.', '2005-10-06 10:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764439, 239392, 24951, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant, aesthetically pleasing still life. 10</td>', 'Simple, elegant, aesthetically pleasing still life. 10', '2005-10-06 10:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764441, 239128, 33515, '<td valign="top">The red and green work well, seems a  little dark on my monitor but no mark down on that.</td>', 'The red and green work well, seems a  little dark on my monitor but no mark down on that.', '2005-10-06 10:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764443, 240551, 43463, '<td valign="top">Bold and vibrant colors that really "pop" out from against the deep black background. The only critiques I have is that since the bottom lip is shown with it''s nice curves that you should have complimented the curves evident by not cropping out the curve of the top lip. Both bottom and upper lips should have been shown in fullness. Lastly you could very easily get rid of the top third of the photo - for that added ''emtpy space'' does nothing to compliment the main subject which is located mostly in the bottom right hand portion of the compositon. A square crop would help keep the eye held on the main subjects.</td>', 'Bold and vibrant colors that really "pop" out from against the deep black background. The only critiques I have is that since the bottom lip is shown with it''s nice curves that you should have complimented the curves evident by not cropping out the curve of the top lip. Both bottom and upper lips should have been shown in fullness. Lastly you could very easily get rid of the top third of the photo - for that added ''emtpy space'' does nothing to compliment the main subject which is located mostly in the bottom right hand portion of the compositon. A square crop would help keep the eye held on the main subjects.', '2005-10-06 10:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764444, 239617, 24951, '<td valign="top">A little too centered IMO. Cropping my be an option.</td>', 'A little too centered IMO. Cropping my be an option.', '2005-10-06 10:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764447, 239504, 33515, '<td valign="top">Seems this was posted in a thread, never a good idea during the challenge.</td>', 'Seems this was posted in a thread, never a good idea during the challenge.', '2005-10-06 10:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764453, 240358, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like the water drops on the apples for it invokes the idea of natural juices and gets the taste buds watering to take a bite out of the apples pictured. Lighting on the apples is good and compliments them well with regards to illumination and play of shadows. The main thing that robs the strength of this image is the choice of background and floor plane. The beige white does not compliment the composition. Perhaps a deep black one would have because it would have made the green and red "pop" off the page. Or possibly a deep rich brown one could have added some ''warmth'' to the scene.</td>', 'I like the water drops on the apples for it invokes the idea of natural juices and gets the taste buds watering to take a bite out of the apples pictured. Lighting on the apples is good and compliments them well with regards to illumination and play of shadows. The main thing that robs the strength of this image is the choice of background and floor plane. The beige white does not compliment the composition. Perhaps a deep black one would have because it would have made the green and red "pop" off the page. Or possibly a deep rich brown one could have added some ''warmth'' to the scene.', '2005-10-06 10:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764456, 239898, 24951, '<td valign="top">This would have been great if it was in focus.</td>', 'This would have been great if it was in focus.', '2005-10-06 11:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764457, 239951, 33515, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, it shows the whole color wheel. To me it is cropped in to tight and would have benefited showing more of the beach and ocean. But that''s just me.  Good Luck</td>', 'I like this idea, it shows the whole color wheel. To me it is cropped in to tight and would have benefited showing more of the beach and ocean. But that''s just me.  Good Luck', '2005-10-06 11:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764458, 238932, 33515, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the colors well very well</td>', 'Very nice, the colors well very well', '2005-10-06 11:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764459, 238305, 24951, '<td valign="top">The busy back and foreground takes away from  the main subject IMO.</td>', 'The busy back and foreground takes away from  the main subject IMO.', '2005-10-06 11:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764460, 240231, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice but seems a bit foggy.</td>', 'Nice but seems a bit foggy.', '2005-10-06 11:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764462, 238971, 29474, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I wouldn''t have put them on a blue plate though.</td>', 'Nice idea. I wouldn''t have put them on a blue plate though.', '2005-10-06 11:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764464, 240538, 24951, '<td valign="top">IMO needs to cropped - too centered.</td>', 'IMO needs to cropped - too centered.', '2005-10-06 11:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764467, 239905, 43463, '<td valign="top">You know I had thought about doing a  pumpkin with a carved face and  lit from  within by  a blue light on a black background:-)  The orange of the pumpkin could be a richer hue if it was paired with a blue that is not a flat blue seen here in the sky (just a thought, perhaps if you had laid the pumpkin on a velvet cloth of royal blue it would have made for a richer hue on both colors). Also the hand holding the pumpkin detracts from the main focus which would have been just the pumpkin with the blue sky as a backdrop.</td>', 'You know I had thought about doing a  pumpkin with a carved face and  lit from  within by  a blue light on a black background:-)  The orange of the pumpkin could be a richer hue if it was paired with a blue that is not a flat blue seen here in the sky (just a thought, perhaps if you had laid the pumpkin on a velvet cloth of royal blue it would have made for a richer hue on both colors). Also the hand holding the pumpkin detracts from the main focus which would have been just the pumpkin with the blue sky as a backdrop.', '2005-10-06 11:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764469, 239640, 33161, '<td valign="top">GREAT COLORS &amp; COMPOSITION, YOUR DOING MUCH BETTER.</td>', 'GREAT COLORS & COMPOSITION, YOUR DOING MUCH BETTER.', '2005-10-06 11:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764474, 237705, 24951, '<td valign="top">I woulf have liked to have seen this sized at 640.</td>', 'I woulf have liked to have seen this sized at 640.', '2005-10-06 11:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764476, 238244, 45493, '<td valign="top">Hello from the Virginia nut with the V-rod</td>', 'Hello from the Virginia nut with the V-rod', '2005-10-06 11:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764478, 237468, 43463, '<td valign="top">A tighter focus on the boats with less "empty space" of the sandy beach surrounding them would have immediately called our attention to the colors within the boats. As the image stands now, the viewer notices the beach and two boats sitting there at first glance. Then after we look at it for short while we notice more of the details. A tighter composition that primarily just contains the two boats within the frame would capture our attention more readily.</td>', 'A tighter focus on the boats with less "empty space" of the sandy beach surrounding them would have immediately called our attention to the colors within the boats. As the image stands now, the viewer notices the beach and two boats sitting there at first glance. Then after we look at it for short while we notice more of the details. A tighter composition that primarily just contains the two boats within the frame would capture our attention more readily.', '2005-10-06 11:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764486, 238453, 43463, '<td valign="top">I am rather confused at the title for when looking at the image itself I see the player numbers of 25 and 22 primarily that I don''t think of the team scores. I think a tighter focus on those two numbered players would have made for a better capture. The oranges on the team uniform are definately vibrant and bold but the blue hues on the other teams is just too deep and dark to be really noticeable in this light other than what we see in the highlighted sheen coming off the pants and shirt sporadically.</td>', 'I am rather confused at the title for when looking at the image itself I see the player numbers of 25 and 22 primarily that I don''t think of the team scores. I think a tighter focus on those two numbered players would have made for a better capture. The oranges on the team uniform are definately vibrant and bold but the blue hues on the other teams is just too deep and dark to be really noticeable in this light other than what we see in the highlighted sheen coming off the pants and shirt sporadically.', '2005-10-06 11:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764490, 240602, 44979, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!!</td>', 'Brilliant!!', '2005-10-06 11:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764492, 240129, 24951, '<td valign="top">IMO it would have been more effective if at least the top of the photo had been cropped and maybe one side so as to de-center the red tulip.</td>', 'IMO it would have been more effective if at least the top of the photo had been cropped and maybe one side so as to de-center the red tulip.', '2005-10-06 11:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764496, 240608, 44979, '<td valign="top">Cool!</td>', 'Cool!', '2005-10-06 11:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764497, 239621, 43463, '<td valign="top">The colors are bold and vibrant and the idea is good, but it could have been composed better. Since the title plays on the idea of "clothes hanging out to dry" it might have improved the image if you had used the orange clothes pin to hold this blue cloth on a clothesline (or at least just give it the appearance of such) that actually shows a bit of that clothesline in the shot. It would still be a close-up shot but it would show the sceen from a different angle in that the viewer is given the impression that they are standing at eye level and zeroing on just a small portion of viewing clothes hanged outside to dry.</td>', 'The colors are bold and vibrant and the idea is good, but it could have been composed better. Since the title plays on the idea of "clothes hanging out to dry" it might have improved the image if you had used the orange clothes pin to hold this blue cloth on a clothesline (or at least just give it the appearance of such) that actually shows a bit of that clothesline in the shot. It would still be a close-up shot but it would show the sceen from a different angle in that the viewer is given the impression that they are standing at eye level and zeroing on just a small portion of viewing clothes hanged outside to dry.', '2005-10-06 11:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764505, 239379, 39962, '<td valign="top">Very daring and different.  I like it!!!  9</td>', 'Very daring and different.  I like it!!!  9', '2005-10-06 11:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764506, 240008, 43463, '<td valign="top">Better lighting could have really made this image "pop" off the screen. As the picture stands the lighting gives it a dull flat look especially to the purples which I envision as really being a deep rich purple hue. Not to mention some of the sheen on the purple petals causes them to appear "plastic".</td>', 'Better lighting could have really made this image "pop" off the screen. As the picture stands the lighting gives it a dull flat look especially to the purples which I envision as really being a deep rich purple hue. Not to mention some of the sheen on the purple petals causes them to appear "plastic".', '2005-10-06 11:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764511, 238305, 39962, '<td valign="top">The passion flower is a viney grower. This seems not natural. The sizes of yellow flowers and the color of the grass do not compliment the passion blossom.  4</td>', 'The passion flower is a viney grower. This seems not natural. The sizes of yellow flowers and the color of the grass do not compliment the passion blossom.  4', '2005-10-06 11:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764514, 240074, 39962, '<td valign="top">I hope you win, because you are good.</td>', 'I hope you win, because you are good.', '2005-10-06 11:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764610, 240112, 39664, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty photo.  Under the definition of Complementay colors, they are colors that are across from each orher on the color wheel, such as red and green, purple and orange.  Black is not a color, but a shade.</td>', 'This is a very pretty photo.  Under the definition of Complementay colors, they are colors that are across from each orher on the color wheel, such as red and green, purple and orange.  Black is not a color, but a shade.', '2005-10-06 12:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764613, 240379, 39664, '<td valign="top">Foreground seems a tad oversharpened/blown out.  Good use of comp colors!</td>', 'Foreground seems a tad oversharpened/blown out.  Good use of comp colors!', '2005-10-06 12:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1764616, 240438, 39664, '<td valign="top">or rock....nice use of humor and comp colors!</td>', 'or rock....nice use of humor and comp colors!', '2005-10-06 12:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
