(1764666, 240105, 43774, '<td valign="top">Interesting, not sure how you did this within the rules, but it''s neat. (oh, I think I see it now, the orange flower is placed on top of a picture of the vase of flowers?)</td>', 'Interesting, not sure how you did this within the rules, but it''s neat. (oh, I think I see it now, the orange flower is placed on top of a picture of the vase of flowers?)', '2005-10-06 12:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
