(1765331, 240111, 40644, '<td valign="top">The coloring of the cater-ma-peller is great, but the apple could really use a shine to help it pop against the white. Nice shot though.</td>', 'The coloring of the cater-ma-peller is great, but the apple could really use a shine to help it pop against the white. Nice shot though.', '2005-10-06 16:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765333, 240210, 42409, '<td valign="top">Cool photo but next time maybe make it a little more exciting.</td>', 'Cool photo but next time maybe make it a little more exciting.', '2005-10-06 16:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765334, 240191, 32644, '<td valign="top">This ice bowl is a great idea. Looks like a fun setup. I do find the stem in the top middle a bit distracting.</td>', 'This ice bowl is a great idea. Looks like a fun setup. I do find the stem in the top middle a bit distracting.', '2005-10-06 16:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765337, 240355, 32644, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot for this competition. I would like to see the whole subject to see what it is.</td>', 'This is a cool shot for this competition. I would like to see the whole subject to see what it is.', '2005-10-06 17:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765339, 240512, 42409, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat photo and the contrasting colors are great!</td>', 'This is a really neat photo and the contrasting colors are great!', '2005-10-06 17:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765340, 240591, 40644, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and a really fun idea but there are a couple of things that I think could''ve make this image really rock. One would be to get rid of the seam/wrinkle in the drop cloth. And two would be to have switched the places of the orange and blue. I think having it a little closer to the light source would really help it stand out more. Alternativaly (or maybe in conjunction with) using a white backdrop might have helped achieve the same goal. Really fun image though!</td>', 'Nice shot and a really fun idea but there are a couple of things that I think could''ve make this image really rock. One would be to get rid of the seam/wrinkle in the drop cloth. And two would be to have switched the places of the orange and blue. I think having it a little closer to the light source would really help it stand out more. Alternativaly (or maybe in conjunction with) using a white backdrop might have helped achieve the same goal. Really fun image though!', '2005-10-06 17:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765345, 239610, 32644, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot. I would like to have seen a bit more of the center of the flower - to add a little more of that color. Amazing colors in moonlight.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot. I would like to have seen a bit more of the center of the flower - to add a little more of that color. Amazing colors in moonlight.', '2005-10-06 17:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1765346, 240360, 40644, '<td valign="top">This one make me stop and look at it for a second. I love the colors here and I love the abstract angle that makes the mind take note. Very nice use of the gradient in the background.</td>', 'This one make me stop and look at it for a second. I love the colors here and I love the abstract angle that makes the mind take note. Very nice use of the gradient in the background.', '2005-10-06 17:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
