(1766536, 238244, 10432, '<td valign="top">This looks like a ribbon contender.  Great color and sharp focus.  Excellent DoF and composition.  Best of luck! 10</td>', 'This looks like a ribbon contender.  Great color and sharp focus.  Excellent DoF and composition.  Best of luck! 10', '2005-10-06 23:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766541, 239501, 30881, '<td valign="top">After years of watching sunsets I''ve never seen one reflect that red on ripply water. What a great find. Very good Congrats</td>', 'After years of watching sunsets I''ve never seen one reflect that red on ripply water. What a great find. Very good Congrats', '2005-10-06 23:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766542, 237710, 39919, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, I like the lighting, I like the colors, I don''t like the focus.</td>', 'I like the subject, I like the lighting, I like the colors, I don''t like the focus.', '2005-10-06 23:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766547, 240422, 10432, '<td valign="top">Horse Chestnuts!!  I love these - used to gather them as a kid - they were so pretty &amp; smooth.<br/>Sharp focus.  Lighting is a tad harsh - and I think I would have preferred a less tight crop.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-11-26 21:49:04.</i></td>', 'Horse Chestnuts!!  I love these - used to gather them as a kid - they were so pretty & smooth.Sharp focus.  Lighting is a tad harsh - and I think I would have preferred a less tight crop.', '2005-10-06 23:32:30.000000', '2005-11-26 21:49:04.000000', 1),
(1766558, 240356, 39919, '<td valign="top">Yellow and blue are not complements.</td>', 'Yellow and blue are not complements.', '2005-10-06 23:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766559, 240129, 30881, '<td valign="top">The foreground flowers have a nice sharp feel and the ones in background are blurred just the right amount,. Would have liked to see the top area with the big white clump cropped out of the image. Overall this is very good and should makle the top ten if not the top 5. Congrats.</td>', 'The foreground flowers have a nice sharp feel and the ones in background are blurred just the right amount,. Would have liked to see the top area with the big white clump cropped out of the image. Overall this is very good and should makle the top ten if not the top 5. Congrats.', '2005-10-06 23:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766563, 238932, 30881, '<td valign="top">VEry good. Really like the lighting and texture feel of this. Lighting on background is also very good. ''9''</td>', 'VEry good. Really like the lighting and texture feel of this. Lighting on background is also very good. ''9''', '2005-10-06 23:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766564, 240173, 39919, '<td valign="top">I think this one is my favorite</td>', 'I think this one is my favorite', '2005-10-06 23:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1766582, 240410, 37893, '<td valign="top">A good shot Fetor but it doesn''t meet the challenge for complimentary colors. I remember you posted this on a thread after your trip so that''s why I knew it was yours as soon as I saw it. The bubbles are great as well as the focus.</td>', 'A good shot Fetor but it doesn''t meet the challenge for complimentary colors. I remember you posted this on a thread after your trip so that''s why I knew it was yours as soon as I saw it. The bubbles are great as well as the focus.', '2005-10-06 23:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
