(1766778, 240007, 18799, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing the complimentary colors.  I would expect to see green with red, blue with orange, or purple with yellow.   Nice macro of a bee though.</td>', 'I''m not seeing the complimentary colors.  I would expect to see green with red, blue with orange, or purple with yellow.   Nice macro of a bee though.', '2005-10-07 00:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1767117, 239163, 18073, '<td valign="top">In order to pull off a shot like these you really need to knock that background out of focus.  Needed to be much closer to the subject and use as wide an aperture as you can.<br/> <br/>As it is, I find the background way to busy and the floweres just dont stand out enough  2/10</td>', 'In order to pull off a shot like these you really need to knock that background out of focus.  Needed to be much closer to the subject and use as wide an aperture as you can. As it is, I find the background way to busy and the floweres just dont stand out enough  2/10', '2005-10-07 03:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1767127, 237512, 18073, '<td valign="top">Beautiful  image, and I guess you could argue that the muted colours of the clothing kind of compliment each other.</td>', 'Beautiful  image, and I guess you could argue that the muted colours of the clothing kind of compliment each other.', '2005-10-07 04:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
