(1767272, 240472, 40386, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, the colors and the angle are great, pity that it isnt sharper.  It almost looks as if it was incorrectly exposed and manipulated in a photo editing program which has left the colors noisy and soft?  A bit of fill flash would have perked it up a lot</td>', 'I like this shot, the colors and the angle are great, pity that it isnt sharper.  It almost looks as if it was incorrectly exposed and manipulated in a photo editing program which has left the colors noisy and soft?  A bit of fill flash would have perked it up a lot', '2005-10-07 07:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
