(1767276, 237991, 40386, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot but it doesnt appear to have a point of focus, overall softness spoils it.</td>', 'This is a nice shot but it doesnt appear to have a point of focus, overall softness spoils it.', '2005-10-07 07:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
