(1767285, 237962, 40386, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but a bit of fill flash would have improved it a lot.  The overall yellow cast from the lighting spoils it and it looks a bit soft overall.  Maybe bouncing the flash off the ceiling to avoid too much flare on the shiny apples?</td>', 'Nice idea but a bit of fill flash would have improved it a lot.  The overall yellow cast from the lighting spoils it and it looks a bit soft overall.  Maybe bouncing the flash off the ceiling to avoid too much flare on the shiny apples?', '2005-10-07 07:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
