(1767435, 240073, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m taking a literal interpretation of this challenge, and so since your photo is in black and white and not color, I''m giving it a lower score. Also, I find the large black shadow object on the right side very distracting - although I realize that it the "shadow" you fear. Perhaps if it had a more definitive shape it would help?</td>', 'I''m taking a literal interpretation of this challenge, and so since your photo is in black and white and not color, I''m giving it a lower score. Also, I find the large black shadow object on the right side very distracting - although I realize that it the "shadow" you fear. Perhaps if it had a more definitive shape it would help?', '2005-10-07 10:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1767436, 237825, 41675, '<td valign="top">While I find this an interseting setup and concept, for me, it doesn''t meet the challenge of complimentary colors and I have given it a low score. The composition isn''t bad, but the light is a bit bright and I find the fingers dristracting. Maybe a bit less yellow color overall would help? Like I said though, an interesting concept - shows creativity and imagination.</td>', 'While I find this an interseting setup and concept, for me, it doesn''t meet the challenge of complimentary colors and I have given it a low score. The composition isn''t bad, but the light is a bit bright and I find the fingers dristracting. Maybe a bit less yellow color overall would help? Like I said though, an interesting concept - shows creativity and imagination.', '2005-10-07 10:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
