(1768053, 240495, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this photo is too dark overall to really get a good sense of complementary green and red as indicated by your title. The landscape itself looks nice, and good composition, but I wish there was a bit more light and less shadows/darkness.</td>', 'For me, this photo is too dark overall to really get a good sense of complementary green and red as indicated by your title. The landscape itself looks nice, and good composition, but I wish there was a bit more light and less shadows/darkness.', '2005-10-07 15:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768056, 239654, 41675, '<td valign="top">To me, it looks like this was almost...."forced" into complementary colors using a photo-editing program. The look itself isn''t bad, but compared to other entries in the challenge, doesn''t meet my concept of comlimentary colors.</td>', 'To me, it looks like this was almost...."forced" into complementary colors using a photo-editing program. The look itself isn''t bad, but compared to other entries in the challenge, doesn''t meet my concept of comlimentary colors.', '2005-10-07 15:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768058, 240610, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, while I think this is a really cute photo, it doesn''t meet the complementary colors challenge as well as other entries. Very sweet eyes though.</td>', 'For me, while I think this is a really cute photo, it doesn''t meet the complementary colors challenge as well as other entries. Very sweet eyes though.', '2005-10-07 15:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768063, 237469, 41675, '<td valign="top">I find this an interesting photo and effect. As for the colors though, to me they are too muted and dark, and I can''t quite tell if that''s a very dark forest green and maybe a darker violet? I wonder if a stronger light source or additional sharpening would increase the overall color effect?</td>', 'I find this an interesting photo and effect. As for the colors though, to me they are too muted and dark, and I can''t quite tell if that''s a very dark forest green and maybe a darker violet? I wonder if a stronger light source or additional sharpening would increase the overall color effect?', '2005-10-07 15:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768064, 240547, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the red, white and blue are complementary, but the photo seems a bit washed out. Also, I think if the shirt in the lower right were cropped out it would put the focus back onto the planes themselves.</td>', 'For me, the red, white and blue are complementary, but the photo seems a bit washed out. Also, I think if the shirt in the lower right were cropped out it would put the focus back onto the planes themselves.', '2005-10-07 15:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1768067, 237962, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but the orange/yellow cast is so very....bright (for lack of better technical terms), I feel the need to squint a bit when looking. Also, a bit more sharpening or focus on the red apple itself would help boost the overall appeal.</td>', 'I like the concept, but the orange/yellow cast is so very....bright (for lack of better technical terms), I feel the need to squint a bit when looking. Also, a bit more sharpening or focus on the red apple itself would help boost the overall appeal.', '2005-10-07 15:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
