(1768305, 240228, 43404, '<td valign="top">I wish this had been angled differently so you could see down into the rose more but it is very pretty and fits the challenge.</td>', 'I wish this had been angled differently so you could see down into the rose more but it is very pretty and fits the challenge.', '2005-10-07 18:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
