(1769470, 238926, 36377, '<td valign="top">A polarizer might have cut down on some of the glare and a couple of your edges seem blown out. Wonderful idea though. Makes me think of christmas with the colors and the lights. I love the reflection of the filaments.</td>', 'A polarizer might have cut down on some of the glare and a couple of your edges seem blown out. Wonderful idea though. Makes me think of christmas with the colors and the lights. I love the reflection of the filaments.', '2005-10-08 05:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769473, 238923, 36377, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the background blurred more. It would center more focus on the child. Would also like to see her eyes instead of looking down. I''m not sure pink and blue are complementary but I''m not going to judge too much on that with all the debate going on. The colors look nice together and that''s enough for me.</td>', 'I''d like to see the background blurred more. It would center more focus on the child. Would also like to see her eyes instead of looking down. I''m not sure pink and blue are complementary but I''m not going to judge too much on that with all the debate going on. The colors look nice together and that''s enough for me.', '2005-10-08 05:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769474, 237901, 36377, '<td valign="top">There are a couple of bothersome shadows from the water. Nice capture on the water and this is a nice water abstract. Seems a little out of focus/soft on the orange object being dropped which causes my focus to beome the crisp water but I keep going back to the bright color. Hope this helps. I''m just writing as I study it.</td>', 'There are a couple of bothersome shadows from the water. Nice capture on the water and this is a nice water abstract. Seems a little out of focus/soft on the orange object being dropped which causes my focus to beome the crisp water but I keep going back to the bright color. Hope this helps. I''m just writing as I study it.', '2005-10-08 05:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769476, 240186, 36377, '<td valign="top">My eye is immediately drawn to the the center of the flower, but the focus seems to be closer. I would have added a bit more depth of field to try and get it all in focus. I like the vivid color on the dry, brown dirt.</td>', 'My eye is immediately drawn to the the center of the flower, but the focus seems to be closer. I would have added a bit more depth of field to try and get it all in focus. I like the vivid color on the dry, brown dirt.', '2005-10-08 05:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769478, 238777, 36377, '<td valign="top">There seems to be some very odd pixelation on this shot. Maybe it''s the smaller size? I like the abstract feel to it but I think for this challenge there may be too many colors. I would have tried to zoom in a little more on just a couple selected colors. My eye also tends to wonder all over without finding a spot to settle on. The closest are the black/purple peppers.</td>', 'There seems to be some very odd pixelation on this shot. Maybe it''s the smaller size? I like the abstract feel to it but I think for this challenge there may be too many colors. I would have tried to zoom in a little more on just a couple selected colors. My eye also tends to wonder all over without finding a spot to settle on. The closest are the black/purple peppers.', '2005-10-08 05:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769479, 239841, 36377, '<td valign="top">Open challenges suck. I''d like to see this later with the glare on the ball cloned out. The only other minor gripe I have is I would like to see the hole a little more to the left to increase the compostion. Good composition even with and very vivid red grabs attention immediately. This would make a great stock photo.</td>', 'Open challenges suck. I''d like to see this later with the glare on the ball cloned out. The only other minor gripe I have is I would like to see the hole a little more to the left to increase the compostion. Good composition even with and very vivid red grabs attention immediately. This would make a great stock photo.', '2005-10-08 05:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769481, 238244, 36377, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the red background extended all the way to the right and a polarizer to help cut come of the glare. I like the concept and composition.</td>', 'I''d like to see the red background extended all the way to the right and a polarizer to help cut come of the glare. I like the concept and composition.', '2005-10-08 05:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769482, 240231, 36377, '<td valign="top">Photo looks a little washed out. Try increasing contrast. Might help take care of it.Looks like light hitting the lens to me. You''ve probably heard this about a hundred time by now but complementary colors.</td>', 'Photo looks a little washed out. Try increasing contrast. Might help take care of it.Looks like light hitting the lens to me. You''ve probably heard this about a hundred time by now but complementary colors.', '2005-10-08 05:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769485, 240379, 36377, '<td valign="top">The background makes this photo for me . Love the shadow play from the leaves. The colors seem a little off to me though. The red looks a little pinkish and the green seems too yellow. Kinda neon looking. I do calibrate my monitor but that may not say a whole lot.</td>', 'The background makes this photo for me . Love the shadow play from the leaves. The colors seem a little off to me though. The red looks a little pinkish and the green seems too yellow. Kinda neon looking. I do calibrate my monitor but that may not say a whole lot.', '2005-10-08 05:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769486, 240043, 36377, '<td valign="top">Nice color combination with the hair, eyes, and background. the only complaint I have is the light on her left cheek/neck, right side of photo, seems a little green. Reflection from background? Nice photo nonetheless and cute model.</td>', 'Nice color combination with the hair, eyes, and background. the only complaint I have is the light on her left cheek/neck, right side of photo, seems a little green. Reflection from background? Nice photo nonetheless and cute model.', '2005-10-08 06:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769488, 238048, 36377, '<td valign="top">Great composition.</td>', 'Great composition.', '2005-10-08 06:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769494, 240512, 36377, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  I''m trying to get some flaws for you but you made it difficult. The only thing I can think of is maybe adding a little more room on the left but thats pretty minor.</td>', 'Great photo.  I''m trying to get some flaws for you but you made it difficult. The only thing I can think of is maybe adding a little more room on the left but thats pretty minor.', '2005-10-08 06:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769530, 240484, 36377, '<td valign="top">If only I could remember who I''ve seen this shot from before. Too lazy to look it up and doesn''t really matter for the pic. I think I like this colored version better than the other I saw before.  The green background really makes the red pop. There are a couple hightlights on the red that might be better removed but it might just make it look flat if it was. Worth a look at at least. Does that last sentence make sense? The shadow on the left/bottom adds depth but it also a little distracting. Mainly in the top curve. Excellent composition, great colors, and one of the better abstracts I''ve seen. I''m very picky on abstracts. This almost seems more graphic than abstract to me though. Hope this isn''t too long winded and helps at least a little.</td>', 'If only I could remember who I''ve seen this shot from before. Too lazy to look it up and doesn''t really matter for the pic. I think I like this colored version better than the other I saw before.  The green background really makes the red pop. There are a couple hightlights on the red that might be better removed but it might just make it look flat if it was. Worth a look at at least. Does that last sentence make sense? The shadow on the left/bottom adds depth but it also a little distracting. Mainly in the top curve. Excellent composition, great colors, and one of the better abstracts I''ve seen. I''m very picky on abstracts. This almost seems more graphic than abstract to me though. Hope this isn''t too long winded and helps at least a little.', '2005-10-08 07:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1769588, 238785, 33352, '<td valign="top">This is a really tough challenge, and you have captured a deep range of colors that work well together,you really can''t beat nature,great work....10</td>', 'This is a really tough challenge, and you have captured a deep range of colors that work well together,you really can''t beat nature,great work....10', '2005-10-08 08:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
