(1770634, 240270, 19936, '<td valign="top">Some may argue that this is more than two complementary colors but I think it is one of the most imaginative shots in the challenge. Well done.</td>', 'Some may argue that this is more than two complementary colors but I think it is one of the most imaginative shots in the challenge. Well done.', '2005-10-08 20:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
