(1770719, 240591, 40323, '<td valign="top">haha, great idea and execution!  made me laugh when I saw it.  A lighter background would probably make the runaway brushes stand out more.</td>', 'haha, great idea and execution!  made me laugh when I saw it.  A lighter background would probably make the runaway brushes stand out more.', '2005-10-08 22:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
