(1771940, 239677, 16488, '<td valign="top">The composition is pleasing.  Like the choice of magenta and yellow. The focus seems off, however, and the pollen makes this a bit messy.</td>', 'The composition is pleasing.  Like the choice of magenta and yellow. The focus seems off, however, and the pollen makes this a bit messy.', '2005-10-09 14:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771943, 240375, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. I wonder if a square crop would have helped emphasize the shape of the bowl. The studio quality of the shot is belied by the reflections from the sky and trees. Grain is not bad, but it is noticeable.</td>', 'Interesting subject. I wonder if a square crop would have helped emphasize the shape of the bowl. The studio quality of the shot is belied by the reflections from the sky and trees. Grain is not bad, but it is noticeable.', '2005-10-09 15:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771945, 238968, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture of this water bird. Though your title implies that I should accept the blue of the eye as the complement to the orange, it just doesn''t seem that color is answering the challenge very well.</td>', 'Lovely picture of this water bird. Though your title implies that I should accept the blue of the eye as the complement to the orange, it just doesn''t seem that color is answering the challenge very well.', '2005-10-09 15:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771948, 240064, 16488, '<td valign="top">The subject is a nice choice. The dull white sky in the upper left corner detracts from the composition.  I like the crispness of the textures. It just seems that there were opportutnities to present your topic more dramatically.</td>', 'The subject is a nice choice. The dull white sky in the upper left corner detracts from the composition.  I like the crispness of the textures. It just seems that there were opportutnities to present your topic more dramatically.', '2005-10-09 15:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771950, 239143, 16488, '<td valign="top">A well done image.  Texture, focus, both spot on. I just don''t see the challenge topic being represented here.</td>', 'A well done image.  Texture, focus, both spot on. I just don''t see the challenge topic being represented here.', '2005-10-09 15:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771951, 240610, 16488, '<td valign="top">Cute expression. Interesting framing of the subject.  The dirt on the dogs face is moderately distracting. To me, black and white are not complementary colors.</td>', 'Cute expression. Interesting framing of the subject.  The dirt on the dogs face is moderately distracting. To me, black and white are not complementary colors.', '2005-10-09 15:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771954, 238568, 16488, '<td valign="top">The color is there. The painting with light is an interesting choice. It appears that long-exposure may have created some problems for the success of this image, however, as evidenced by the burnt out pixels, the noise and the muddy background.</td>', 'The color is there. The painting with light is an interesting choice. It appears that long-exposure may have created some problems for the success of this image, however, as evidenced by the burnt out pixels, the noise and the muddy background.', '2005-10-09 15:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771957, 239165, 16488, '<td valign="top">The colors are a bit weak for the challenge topic. The square crop compliments the circular composition, but the subject itself does not carry a great deal of interest or appeal for me.</td>', 'The colors are a bit weak for the challenge topic. The square crop compliments the circular composition, but the subject itself does not carry a great deal of interest or appeal for me.', '2005-10-09 15:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771958, 238897, 16488, '<td valign="top">The composition is pleasing in its layout. The image seems over exposed and the focus off.</td>', 'The composition is pleasing in its layout. The image seems over exposed and the focus off.', '2005-10-09 15:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771962, 240065, 16488, '<td valign="top">The blossom has a great deal of character and depth. The lighting on the bloom is dull, however.  The background tree is somewhat distracting. Noise lends a bit of an old-fashioned feel to the subject, just too many distractors to make this an exception rendering of the subject.</td>', 'The blossom has a great deal of character and depth. The lighting on the bloom is dull, however.  The background tree is somewhat distracting. Noise lends a bit of an old-fashioned feel to the subject, just too many distractors to make this an exception rendering of the subject.', '2005-10-09 15:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771964, 240381, 16488, '<td valign="top">The colors are there. The composition has merit. However I''d like to see the entire blossom in focus. The stamen seem overexposed.</td>', 'The colors are there. The composition has merit. However I''d like to see the entire blossom in focus. The stamen seem overexposed.', '2005-10-09 15:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771969, 239607, 16488, '<td valign="top">A colorful photo. Is it a good example of complementary colors? I don''t think so. The orange and green crayons in the foreground could have helped satisfy the challenge topic if they were more present in the picture, perhaps.  The objects and the top distract, the white to the right seems unnecessary--perhaps cropping in a bit more would have improved this composition.</td>', 'A colorful photo. Is it a good example of complementary colors? I don''t think so. The orange and green crayons in the foreground could have helped satisfy the challenge topic if they were more present in the picture, perhaps.  The objects and the top distract, the white to the right seems unnecessary--perhaps cropping in a bit more would have improved this composition.', '2005-10-09 15:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1771970, 240359, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting study in shape and line. The orange rust and the pale blue paint almost make this fit the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting study in shape and line. The orange rust and the pale blue paint almost make this fit the challenge.', '2005-10-09 15:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
