(1772458, 239736, 36377, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea here. NIce job lighting the glass. A few blown out hightlights but acceptable in my opinion. Shame the blue background is so spotty. That''s basic editing for you. The only real complaint I have is the shot seems kind of static. Maybe a more exciting composition. Once again beautiful idea.</td>', 'Wonderful idea here. NIce job lighting the glass. A few blown out hightlights but acceptable in my opinion. Shame the blue background is so spotty. That''s basic editing for you. The only real complaint I have is the shot seems kind of static. Maybe a more exciting composition. Once again beautiful idea.', '2005-10-09 21:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
