(1772511, 237547, 36377, '<td valign="top">One of the best architecural shot i''ve seen. Love the how the left side is very abstract/graphic. The right lets you know it''s a building. I wonder if this is the actual color of the building or sunlight. I''m trying to find a nitpick to make this comment useful to you but I''m drawing a blank. 10 and straight to the favorites.</td>', 'One of the best architecural shot i''ve seen. Love the how the left side is very abstract/graphic. The right lets you know it''s a building. I wonder if this is the actual color of the building or sunlight. I''m trying to find a nitpick to make this comment useful to you but I''m drawing a blank. 10 and straight to the favorites.', '2005-10-09 21:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1772515, 240351, 42005, '<td valign="top">You know, this really grew on me.  After awhile the bright colors began to all look alike and the soothing tones and peaceful rhythm of this felt very comforting.</td>', 'You know, this really grew on me.  After awhile the bright colors began to all look alike and the soothing tones and peaceful rhythm of this felt very comforting.', '2005-10-09 21:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
