(1776435, 237512, 36001, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you the high score this photograph deserves but I have to say I wasn''t convinced it fitted into complementary colours. However it''s open to interpretation and you''ve taken an excellent shot!</td>', 'I''m giving you the high score this photograph deserves but I have to say I wasn''t convinced it fitted into complementary colours. However it''s open to interpretation and you''ve taken an excellent shot!', '2005-10-11 13:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
