(1777365, 239395, 43191, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo. I can''t see the complementary colours though. I may be wrong however as there has been a lot of talk about differing colour wheels and complementary shades. I''m going to break my voting pattern as I feel that someone who would take such a great shot probably has more idea about complementary colours than me. I''ll assume you know what you''re talking about and give you an 8. Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'A beautiful photo. I can''t see the complementary colours though. I may be wrong however as there has been a lot of talk about differing colour wheels and complementary shades. I''m going to break my voting pattern as I feel that someone who would take such a great shot probably has more idea about complementary colours than me. I''ll assume you know what you''re talking about and give you an 8. Good luck with the challenge.', '2005-10-11 19:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
