(1777438, 240505, 16488, '<td valign="top">Italian flag?<br/>This image could work, but the red is very strange on my monitor, the lighting a bit too harsh (highlights blown and shadows unhelpful). The idea is there, the execution is lacking.</td>', 'Italian flag?This image could work, but the red is very strange on my monitor, the lighting a bit too harsh (highlights blown and shadows unhelpful). The idea is there, the execution is lacking.', '2005-10-11 20:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777442, 239589, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice sculpture. Colors seem off. Background is not pleasing. If you had limited depth of field to blur the green?  Composition is interesting, but the execution is lacking.</td>', 'Nice sculpture. Colors seem off. Background is not pleasing. If you had limited depth of field to blur the green?  Composition is interesting, but the execution is lacking.', '2005-10-11 20:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777446, 237688, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I like how the apples are on a tilted plane and sort of bump together.  I think you needed a bit more focus on the red apple--just too soft to carry it away from the background.  Double and triple edging on the shadows  makes me think you could have controlled the lighting a bit better as well.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I like how the apples are on a tilted plane and sort of bump together.  I think you needed a bit more focus on the red apple--just too soft to carry it away from the background.  Double and triple edging on the shadows  makes me think you could have controlled the lighting a bit better as well.', '2005-10-11 20:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1777447, 239580, 16488, '<td valign="top">Idea is there. Colors are weak. I think that the rope running into the edge of the frame hurts the composition--if you intended that, then I would suggest adding a wider border to make it an obvious choice.</td>', 'Idea is there. Colors are weak. I think that the rope running into the edge of the frame hurts the composition--if you intended that, then I would suggest adding a wider border to make it an obvious choice.', '2005-10-11 20:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
