(1777676, 240583, 16488, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite...if I were choosing this would win.<br/>But, I''m pretty sure it won''t...sorry.<br/>I love the colors!  The play of green on red and red on green really captures the concept of complementary colors--it challenges the eye--it teases the senses--and yet, it is so true to nature!<br/>The textures are wonderful!<br/>The details in the leaf veins delightful!<br/>The beginning of sumac turning...not so obvious when all the world of sumac is shouting out before the un-turned trees to look at me, look at me!<br/>How delightful and delicate this image!<br/>How sweet its composure!<br/>How fine its lines!<br/>How garish its colors!<br/>Thank you for presenting such a bold and daring portrait of autumn!</td>', 'This is my favorite...if I were choosing this would win.But, I''m pretty sure it won''t...sorry.I love the colors!  The play of green on red and red on green really captures the concept of complementary colors--it challenges the eye--it teases the senses--and yet, it is so true to nature!The textures are wonderful!The details in the leaf veins delightful!The beginning of sumac turning...not so obvious when all the world of sumac is shouting out before the un-turned trees to look at me, look at me!How delightful and delicate this image!How sweet its composure!How fine its lines!How garish its colors!Thank you for presenting such a bold and daring portrait of autumn!', '2005-10-11 22:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
