(1778258, 240591, 40106, '<td valign="top">oh man... just this close!!  in my opinion this should''ve gotten a ribbon in place of the splash pic.</td>', 'oh man... just this close!!  in my opinion this should''ve gotten a ribbon in place of the splash pic.', '2005-10-12 01:35:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1778262, 237779, 8178, '<td valign="top">Ah, yes... Another water shot...<br/> <br/>I am very much a beginner, and I''ve been dying to try this. After trying it though I have a new appreciation for these water shots. They are a lot harder than I thought. Very difficult to focus on the drop.<br/> <br/>I did not expect to win at all, not even close, especially given the subject. But I am glad I tried it, I learned a lot.<br/> <br/>Thank you for the positive comments, and I am very excited. Sorry to bore everyone with yet another water drop :)</td>', 'Ah, yes... Another water shot... I am very much a beginner, and I''ve been dying to try this. After trying it though I have a new appreciation for these water shots. They are a lot harder than I thought. Very difficult to focus on the drop. I did not expect to win at all, not even close, especially given the subject. But I am glad I tried it, I learned a lot. Thank you for the positive comments, and I am very excited. Sorry to bore everyone with yet another water drop :)', '2005-10-12 01:36:06.000000', NULL, 0);
