(1778370, 238468, 3724, '<td valign="top">My impression - impressionistic....  highlights are hot, successful in being painterly....  colour saturation might be stronger. Frame and crop are good.  This one is easy to pass over because of the softness.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-12 00:57:50.</i></td>', 'My impression - impressionistic....  highlights are hot, successful in being painterly....  colour saturation might be stronger. Frame and crop are good.  This one is easy to pass over because of the softness.', '2005-10-12 01:52:53.000000', '2005-10-12 01:57:50.000000', 0),
