(1778518, 238932, 36377, '<td valign="top">Trust me zara-opal. everything is real. The color adjustment wasn''t even that drastic. Of course with basic editing you can''t have anything too drastic. I had a hell of a time getting that flower where I wanted it. The only thing bugging me is the dust on the vase and the color banding on the vase and background. Took care of all that in the advanced edit version. A little banding left on it but all I could do for it. Thanks everyone.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-12 04:15:39.</i></td>', 'Trust me zara-opal. everything is real. The color adjustment wasn''t even that drastic. Of course with basic editing you can''t have anything too drastic. I had a hell of a time getting that flower where I wanted it. The only thing bugging me is the dust on the vase and the color banding on the vase and background. Took care of all that in the advanced edit version. A little banding left on it but all I could do for it. Thanks everyone.', '2005-10-12 02:30:53.000000', '2005-10-12 05:15:39.000000', 0),
(1778520, 238435, 29904, '<td valign="top">Not complimentary but great contrast and really nicely done.  Nice depth of field and great cropping.  gave it a 7.  -3 for not meeting the challenge better, but certainly not deserving of less than a 5.  Oh well, they did the same to mine.  Better luck to us both :)</td>', 'Not complimentary but great contrast and really nicely done.  Nice depth of field and great cropping.  gave it a 7.  -3 for not meeting the challenge better, but certainly not deserving of less than a 5.  Oh well, they did the same to mine.  Better luck to us both :)', '2005-10-12 02:31:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1778526, 240472, 3724, '<td valign="top">Unecessary tilting of the picture does not add any interest for me but am ammused by a bit of humor in the depiction of the subject, and I like this raw yellow and purple ..... 7</td>', 'Unecessary tilting of the picture does not add any interest for me but am ammused by a bit of humor in the depiction of the subject, and I like this raw yellow and purple ..... 7', '2005-10-12 02:33:38.000000', NULL, 0),
