(1778571, 238082, 20608, '<td valign="top">Thank you.. i got the colours slightly wrong and its down to my bad eyesight, for sure i thought i set the hue to make it look more purple than red but everyone says its red and yellow, sorry about that.<br/> <br/>Thank you for the after support and Phillip always I am happy when you like my shot because I have so much respect for your photography.. by the way my site is finished and has changed a lot you should visit again we miss your pictures there please visit again <br/> <br/>www.alionic.net<br/></td>', 'Thank you.. i got the colours slightly wrong and its down to my bad eyesight, for sure i thought i set the hue to make it look more purple than red but everyone says its red and yellow, sorry about that. Thank you for the after support and Phillip always I am happy when you like my shot because I have so much respect for your photography.. by the way my site is finished and has changed a lot you should visit again we miss your pictures there please visit again  www.alionic.net', '2005-10-12 02:51:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1778586, 240124, 44923, '<td valign="top">Echan has asked me to thank everybody for taking the time and effort to offer her some help. this is the first time for her to do such a thing and she had great fun and will be entering more challenges. she is very happy with 108th place for first effort</td>', 'Echan has asked me to thank everybody for taking the time and effort to offer her some help. this is the first time for her to do such a thing and she had great fun and will be entering more challenges. she is very happy with 108th place for first effort', '2005-10-12 02:55:21.000000', NULL, 0),
