(1778853, 237976, 19035, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mkalandros:</b></div><hr/><i> Looks a bit grainy.  Maybe use a lower ISO? </i></td></tr></table><i></i> <br/>Shot was taken with iso 100, I think I over sharpened in processing which may have gien the grain to the picture.</td>', 'Originally posted by mkalandros: Looks a bit grainy.  Maybe use a lower ISO?  Shot was taken with iso 100, I think I over sharpened in processing which may have gien the grain to the picture.', '2005-10-12 07:18:34.000000', NULL, 0),
