(1778886, 239624, 45816, '<td valign="top">Well, this one moved me to register so''s I could comment ; )  I really like the idea, probably would have been in my top 10. The colors are great and it''s a wonderful example of not having to look too hard. I think it would have been better composed had about 3/4 of the pepper been in the shot. I love the angle, though.</td>', 'Well, this one moved me to register so''s I could comment ; )  I really like the idea, probably would have been in my top 10. The colors are great and it''s a wonderful example of not having to look too hard. I think it would have been better composed had about 3/4 of the pepper been in the shot. I love the angle, though.', '2005-10-12 07:52:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1778887, 240576, 20608, '<td valign="top">there is a tutorial on how to shoot for brown.. i read it before i shot my brown ribbon winning shot.<br/> <br/>make the image smaller and give it a title like - ''There was in my glassis for close on televison with watch the cartoon you did it''<br/> <br/>however focus was perfect for brown.</td>', 'there is a tutorial on how to shoot for brown.. i read it before i shot my brown ribbon winning shot. make the image smaller and give it a title like - ''There was in my glassis for close on televison with watch the cartoon you did it'' however focus was perfect for brown.', '2005-10-12 07:53:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1778888, 240191, 36981, '<td valign="top">Many thanks to all who voted &amp; commented on this.  It is by far my highest placement at DPC, and I''m feeling really happy!</td>', 'Many thanks to all who voted & commented on this.  It is by far my highest placement at DPC, and I''m feeling really happy!', '2005-10-12 07:53:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1778896, 240512, 44289, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is my first challenge entry and the first time I used my new camera. I am pretty new to this hobby but this seals it.....I''m hooked.  I had planned out a completely different idea but it just didn''t come out the way I wanted.  My original idea was a bit cluttered so at the last minute I decided to go with a simple set up.<br/> <br/>Thank you for all the comments it is truly appreciated.</td>', 'Wow, this is my first challenge entry and the first time I used my new camera. I am pretty new to this hobby but this seals it.....I''m hooked.  I had planned out a completely different idea but it just didn''t come out the way I wanted.  My original idea was a bit cluttered so at the last minute I decided to go with a simple set up. Thank you for all the comments it is truly appreciated.', '2005-10-12 07:59:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1778898, 238244, 36981, '<td valign="top">Well well well, Eden!  Not a bad start at all!  Congratulations on your first dpchallenge pic, and a top ten for that!  Well done!<br/> <br/>BTW, I think it''s a beautiful image &amp; well deserving of its placement!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-12 07:02:31.</i></td>', 'Well well well, Eden!  Not a bad start at all!  Congratulations on your first dpchallenge pic, and a top ten for that!  Well done! BTW, I think it''s a beautiful image & well deserving of its placement!', '2005-10-12 08:01:52.000000', '2005-10-12 08:02:31.000000', 0),
