(1779098, 240512, 29156, '<td valign="top">congrat on your 5th - most often "less is more" in photography as I think you succeed in here</td>', 'congrat on your 5th - most often "less is more" in photography as I think you succeed in here', '2005-10-12 10:07:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1779113, 240576, 12253, '<td valign="top">Were you really trying for a brown.  If so, I''m embarrassed to say I like this :(<br/> <br/>If not, perhaps it got punished for being abstract, or perhaps too many people looked for "something" besides color in the shot.  But the beautiful continuous tones and combinations in the color are very nice.  Perhaps a crop on the left to making it close to square, with the two colors playing against each other and combining in the bottom right quadrant might have been a bit compositionally stronger.  (Still may not have done well in this crowd, but a good pic anyway.)</td>', 'Were you really trying for a brown.  If so, I''m embarrassed to say I like this :( If not, perhaps it got punished for being abstract, or perhaps too many people looked for "something" besides color in the shot.  But the beautiful continuous tones and combinations in the color are very nice.  Perhaps a crop on the left to making it close to square, with the two colors playing against each other and combining in the bottom right quadrant might have been a bit compositionally stronger.  (Still may not have done well in this crowd, but a good pic anyway.)', '2005-10-12 10:14:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1779117, 240561, 32754, '<td valign="top">This was a nice image visually..I liked the texture of the rose as opposed to the smoothness of the gerbera daisy..well composed.</td>', 'This was a nice image visually..I liked the texture of the rose as opposed to the smoothness of the gerbera daisy..well composed.', '2005-10-12 10:15:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1779338, 240173, 28710, '<td valign="top">Man Librodo, next time I go to Thailand, I want to meet YOU! Actually, I want to meet Pupae, but it would be cool to see a little of what you see too.<br/> <br/>I wonder, why is her name in plural? I give out lots of English names to my students as well. I am wondering if perhaps it is based on her Thai name?<br/> <br/>You are seriously amazing. Not to mention that you got this at 1/15th. Oy!</td>', 'Man Librodo, next time I go to Thailand, I want to meet YOU! Actually, I want to meet Pupae, but it would be cool to see a little of what you see too. I wonder, why is her name in plural? I give out lots of English names to my students as well. I am wondering if perhaps it is based on her Thai name? You are seriously amazing. Not to mention that you got this at 1/15th. Oy!', '2005-10-12 11:26:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1779402, 240191, 44107, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bebe:</b></div><hr/><i> Many thanks to all who voted &amp; commented on this.  It is by far my highest placement at DPC, and I''m feeling really happy! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I really feel that had the Ice Bowl been a little more brilliant and glossy rather than gushy you would have made top 5.  It just gives me the feeling of sticky and runny.  Still one of my favorite pictures from this challenge though!</td>', 'Originally posted by Bebe: Many thanks to all who voted & commented on this.  It is by far my highest placement at DPC, and I''m feeling really happy!   I really feel that had the Ice Bowl been a little more brilliant and glossy rather than gushy you would have made top 5.  It just gives me the feeling of sticky and runny.  Still one of my favorite pictures from this challenge though!', '2005-10-12 11:38:25.000000', NULL, 0),
