(1779500, 239654, 32767, '<td valign="top">Judy-I believe you got nailed on the border. I''m a huge, huge border fan and I also like exotic borders as well but this one didn''t work for me. I like it when borders compliment or even offset certain elements in an image and this one looks like an extension of what''s inside the image...maybe too much tonal sameness...if that makes sense???<br/> <br/>Maybe Black-"Pink/Purple"-Black? Very thin band of the pinkish-purple?</td>', 'Judy-I believe you got nailed on the border. I''m a huge, huge border fan and I also like exotic borders as well but this one didn''t work for me. I like it when borders compliment or even offset certain elements in an image and this one looks like an extension of what''s inside the image...maybe too much tonal sameness...if that makes sense??? Maybe Black-"Pink/Purple"-Black? Very thin band of the pinkish-purple?', '2005-10-12 12:14:07.000000', NULL, 0),
